<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Matei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matei</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inojile vyoyandichigwe na Matei ndo chimwe mwa vitabu vine viwele mli ilagano lya sambi vilingusima mbuli ya ukomu wa Yesu Kilistu. Chila chimwe cha vitabu avyo changuchemigwa Injili, ilinguzeleka kota Mbuli Inojile. Navyandichigwa na Matei na Malichi na Lukasi na Yohana, Yesu loyabagame. Wasomile hawavizelele mhela wa Mbuli Inojile ya Matei hoyandichigwe. Ila hanji wangijesa nayali kuli mhela wa makumi sita kulawila Yesu loyavumbuche. Kahi honhu nahoyandichigwe hailinguzeleka. Ila wangijesa kota nayandichigwa Palestina kuli muji wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nayandichigwa na Matei. Nayali mkongoza kodi mhela naloyang'hali chemigwa na Yesu. Yawe mlanguswa wa heye. Kahi nakazeleka kwa itagwa lya Lawi. Matei nayali yumwe mwa wala watumigwa kumi na weli. Nakawandichila Wayahudi weng'ha. Ahi toweza kona kota Matei nakandika kwa Wayahudi kwa vila nakandika iwalile ilagano lya katali mzidi ya mala makumi sita mli chitabu achi. Nakagana kulajila kota Yesu nayali maseya. Mlohozi yahaguligwe na Nguluwi nayalavilwe uloli katali. Matei kahi nakandika menji gawalile Undewa wa Nguluwi. Wayahudi nawejesa kota maseya loyoyile nayahawele mndewa wa isi yeng'ha. Matei nakandika goya kwa kusima mbuli ya undewa wa chimuhe wa Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inojile navyoyandichigwe na Matei. Ndo chitabu chinojile cha kwaluka kulangusila mli ilagano lya sambi kwa vila china menji kulawa mli ilagano lya katali. Changulumbiza malagano meli. Wasomile wenji wangijesa kota Matei nakajeza kwandika kwa kuchiwhaniza chitabu achi na vitabu vihano vya Musa mli ilagano lya katali. Kudamla kwa Yesu kuchidunda Matei sula ya 5-7. Yanguwhanizwa na malajizo goyapegwe Musa. (Kukumbuchila 19:3-23; 33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Matei kangwaluka kwa kusima kuvumbuka kwa Yesu na kwaluka kwa mijito ya heye sula ya 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba Matei kangusima mijito ya Yesu na menji kuli ulanguso wa heye sula ya 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Mwiso Matei kangusima kuduma kwa mijito ya Yesu na kubagama kwa heye na kuzilipuka sula ya 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Lukasi 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Yesu Kilistu kalawila mlukolo lwa Daudi na Daudi nayali wa lukolo lwa Abulahamu na achi ndo chitabu cha lukolo lwa heye.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abulahamu nakamponda Isaka. Isaka nakamponda Yakubu. Na Yakubu nakamponda Yudasi na wakulugwe. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yudasi nakamponda Pelesi na Sela mayao nayali Tamali. Pelesi nakamponda Hesiloni, na Hesiloni nakamponda Lami, <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Lami nakamponda Aminadabu na Aminadabu nakamponda Nashoni. Na Nashoni nakamponda Salimoni. <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salimoni nakamponda Boasi, mayake Boasi nayali Lahabu, Boasi na Lutu nawamponda Obedi, na Obedi nakamponda Jese.<verse eid="MAT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Na heye Jese nakamponda mndewa Daudi, na Daudi nakamponda Solomoni na mayake Solomoni nayali Bath-Sheba mdala wa Uliya. <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Na Solomoni nakamponda Lohoboamu. Na Lohoboamu nakamponda Abiya. Na Abiya nakamponda Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>na Asa nakamponda Yohoshafati. Na Yohoshafati nakamponda Yolamu. Na Yolamu nakamponda Usiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>na Usiya nakamponda Josamu na Josamu nakamponda Ahasi. Na Ahasi nakamponda Hesekiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>na Hesekiya nakamponda Manase. Na Manase nakamponda Amoni. Na Amoni nakamponda Yosiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>na Yosiya nakamponda Yekoniya na wang'holoze. Awo wali mhela Wayahudi wawele mchihamo kuza ako Babiloni.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Kulawa Wayahudi vyowawele mchihamo kuza ako Babiloni, Yekoniya nakamponda Sheatieli, na Sheatieli nakamponda Selubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>na Selubabeli nakamponda Abiudi. Na Abiudi nakamponda Eliakimu, na Eliakimu nakamponda Asoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>na Asoli nakamponda Sadoki. Na Sadoki nakamponda Akimu, na Akimu nakamponda Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>na Eliudi nakamponda Eleasali. Na Eleasali nakamponda Masani, na Masani nakamponda Yakubu, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>na Yakubu nakamponda Yusufu, mlume wa Maliya mayake Yesu, yalinguchemigwa Kilistu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Lelo hamba kwali na lulelo kumi na vine. Kulawa Abulahamu mbaka Daudi, na kumi na vine viyage kulawa Daudi mbaka Wayahudi vyowawele mchihamo kuza ako Babiloni, na kumi na vine viyage kulawa baho mbaka mhela wa Kilistu Mlohozi.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Lukasi 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Lelo ahi ndo vyoyavumbuche Yesu Kilistu. Maliya, mayake Yesu, nakabanichilwa na Yusufu. Ila lowali wang'hali kihola kota munhu na mdala wa heye nakewona kana himila kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Yusufu mzenjele wa Maliya. Kwa vila nayali munhu nayali yodita ganojile, nahaganile kumbasa soni hazelu, ahyo nakagana kubena izenjele kwa uviso. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Vyoyali yochijesa mbuli ayo, mhilisi wa Mkulu kamlawila koyawasile kalota yolonjelwa kota, “Yusufu, mwana wa Daudi, uleche kudumba kumhola Maliya yawe mchewako, kwa vila heye kana himila kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Koponda mwana mlume, na hegwe komha itagwa Yesu, kwa vila heye ndo yowalohola wanhu wa heye kuli gehile ga hewo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Lelo aga geng'ha nagalawila kwenela kwa ula ulonzi wa Mkulu loyalonjile kukolela mloli, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Mdala yohanating'hana na mlume kowa na himila na koponda mwana mlume na hewo womchema itagwa Imanueli izeleche Nguluwi kahamwe na hetwe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Yusufu vyoyalilimche kamhola Maliya kota mhilisi wa Mkulu vyoyamlonjele yadite. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Ila Yusufu nahamzelele Maliya hebu chilukuli mbaka vyoyapondile mwana mlume. Na heye Yusufu nakamchema mwana itagwa lyake Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Wajenzi kulawa kolilawilaga isanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yesu nakapondigwa mujini Betelehemu, mkowa wa Yudeya mhela Helodi loyali Mndewa. Baho du loyapondigwe, walola nhondwe kulawa kolilawilaga isanya nawoya Yelusalemu <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>nawauza, “Kakohi mwana yaleleche yowa Mndewa wa Wayahudi? Tuyona nhondwe ya heye ilawile kolilawilaga isanya tuya kumfugamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Mndewa Helodi vyoyahuliche mbuli ayo na kadeula ng'hatu. Na wanhu weng'ha wali Yelusalemu nawadeula. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Leka, nakawachema hamwe watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na kuwauza, “Ahi kohi koyoleleka Yesu Kilistu?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Na hewo wedichila, “Mujini Betelehemu uwele Yudeya. Yandichigwe na mloli wa Nguluwi kuta,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>“Ee Betelehemu iwele kuli isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">hegwe huwele mdodo ng'hatu kuli luga lutanganiche lwa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">mina kwa hegwe, kolawila mlongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">yowalongoza wanhu wa heni, Isilaeli.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Baho, Helodi nakawachema awala walola nhondwe kwa uviso, na kawauza kota hanili aila nhondwe loiwalawile. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Hamba kawalajiza Betelehemu yolonga, “Mlute mkampale mwana, na wone mmone, muye mndojele na heni ndute ndikamfugamile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Lowamhulichize mndewa, awala walola nhondwe waluta. Baho ila nhondwe lowaiwene kulawa kolilawilaga isanya, na iwalongola na iluta kwima mchanya na hala hoyawele mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Lowaiwene ayo nhondwe, nawasangalala heko. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Leka, wenjila mng'handa, nawamona yula mwana hamwe na Maliya mayake, wenamiza na wamfugamila. Hamba wachumula vinhu vyowegale vya kumigalila mwana, wampa ndolendole zahabu na ubani na mafuta galinguguzigwa kwa migwala minji galinguchemigwa manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Nguluwi nakawalemeza wolota waleche kuhiluka kwa Helodi, ahyo wahiluka kukolela nzila inji.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubilimila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Lowochile awala wajenzi, mhilisi wa Mkulu kamlawila Yusufu yolota, nakamlonjela, “Winuche! Mhole mwana hamwe na mayake, mbilimile Misili. Mikale kuko mbaka hondikulonjela, mina Helodi kangumpala kumkopola ayu mwana.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Ahyo, Yusufu kenuka kamhola mwana na mayake, woka nechilo wabilimila Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Kekala kuko mbaka Helodi loyafile. Mbuli ayo naikoleka leka ulonzi woyalonjile Mkulu kukolela mloli wenele, “Nandimchema mwana wa heni kulawa Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Helodi kanguwakopola wana wadodo wasongolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Helodi loyawene awala walola nhondwe hawahiluche wambada, nakazudila heko. Kalajiza kukopoligwa wana weng'ha wasongolo kuli muji wa Betelehemu wawele na ukulu wa miyaka mili na hasi wakopoligwe. Nakadita ahyo kota vyoyavizelele kulawa kwa wala walola nhondwe. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Baho ndo lwenela luzi ulonjigwe kukolela mloli Yelemiya.<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Luzi luhulikwa ako Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">chililo na kulombocheza kwinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli kanguwalilila wana wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">nakangulema kunyamalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">mina weng'ha wabagama.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulawa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Helodi loyabagame, mhilisi wa Mkulu kamlawila Yusufu yolota kula Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>nakumlonjela, “Winuche! Umuhole mwana na mayake mhiluche ku isi ya Isilaeli, mina wala waganile kumkopola mwana ayo wabagama.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Leka, Yusufu kenuka, kamhola mwana na mayake nakahiluka isi ya Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Ila Yusufu vyoyahuliche kota Achelausi mwanage Helodi, kahola chigoda cha mhaza wa heye, kawa mndewa wa Yudeya, na kadumba kuhiluka ako. Na kalonjelwa menji goyalotile, baho kaluta kikala Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Na kahamila luga lwake luchemigwe Nasaleti. Ndo wenele ulonzi ulonjigwe kukolela Waloli. “Munhu kochemigwa Mnasaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ulanguso wa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malichi 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lukasi 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Mhela wula Yohani Mbatiza loyoyile honhu hagunuche kuli Yudeya, nakaluka kudamla. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>Kawalonjela, “Mumgalamchile Nguluwi, kwa vila undewa wa kilanga wahabehi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Ayu Yohani nayali ndo yula mloli Isaya vyo yasimile mbuli ya heye loyalonjile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Munhu yumwe kanguchema honhu hagunuche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mgongomanyileni Mkulu nzila ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">mgolole nzila ya heye ya kukola.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Yohani nakavala nguwo ihonigwe na milaika ja ngamiya, yakowele izabi lya igozi mchuno. Chilyo cha heye chali nzije na hanombwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Wanhu kulawa Yelusalemu na kulawa nzingo zeng'ha za Yudeya na kulawa isi yeng'ha habehi na lwanda lwa Yolodani nawamlutila, <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>nawalonga gehile gowaditile na heye kawabatiza mli lwanda lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Ila loyawene Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wenji wokuya kwa heye kubatizigwa, kawalonjela, “Hemwe lulelo lwa izoka! Yalikohi yowadeteleza kota moibilima ng'halazi ya Nguluwi ilihabehi kuya? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Mlajile kwa madito kota mumgalamchila Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Mleche kijesa kota sambi moibilima ng'halazi ya Nguluwi kwa kulonga, Mhaza wa hetwe Abulahamu! Ndanguwalonjelani ng'hatu, Nguluwi kana ludali lwa kugagalula aga maganga gawe wana wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Iwago liwichigwa goya kuli mizabi ja igodi. Chila mgodi wohambe ulele mafuza ganojile, wotemangwa na kutajigwa mchiluli. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Heni ndanguwabatiza kwa mazi kuwalajila kota mumgalamchila Nguluwi. Ila heye yokuya kumbele kwa heni, kana ludali kusinda heni, na heni silinguganigwa kupapa makwamba ga heye. Heye kowabatizani kwa Muhe Yelile na kwa chiluli. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Heye kana luhelo lwa kuyugulila nyhadikwa, yalunde uhemba wa heye mli ng'hano, na mibadu kojisoma kwa chiluli chohambe chizime.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubatizigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Malichi 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lukasi 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Mhela awo Yesu nakalawa Galilaya nakafika mlwanda lwa Yolodani, nakamlutila Yohani leka yabatizigwe na heye. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Ila Yohani nakajeza kumlemeza yolonga, “Ndaze, hegwe kwanguya kwa heni? Heni baha ndo ndilinguganigwa kubatizigwa na hegwe!” <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Ila Yesu nakamwidichila, “Uleche hela iwe hino kwa sambi, mina ndo vyoilinguganigwa kugadita gala geng'ha ganojile.” Aho Yohani nakakunda.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Baho Yesu loyasindile kubatizigwa, vyoyalawile kuzibila mlimazi, nabaho kilanga kugubuka nakona Muhe wa Nguluwi yodulika kota nziwa nakwima mmutwi wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Nawahulika lizi kilanga ilonga, “Ayu ndo mwana wa heni ndimganile, nojezwa na heye.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kujezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Malichi 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lukasi 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Hamba Muhe Yelile kamlongoza Yesu kuluta honhu hagunuche kujezigwa na Limazoga. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Navyoyesele kulya chinhu mazuwa makumi gane nemisi na nechilo, na mwiso kehulika nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Hamba Limazoga lyuya kwa Yesu nakumlonjela, “Wone ukomya hegwe uli Mwana wa Nguluwi, ugalonjele aga maganga gawe mibumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yesu kedichila kalonga, “Yandichigwa kuli Maandiko Matakatifu. ‘Munhu howa mkomu kwa ibumunda hela, leka kwa chila ulonzi woyolonga Nguluwi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Hamba Limazoga nalimuhola mbaka Yelusalemu Muji Welile, kamuwika kuchanya chinhembenhembe kuli chinduwiko cha ng'handa ya Nguluwi, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>nakamlonjela, “Wone uwele Mwana wa Nguluwi, yetoze hanyi, mina yandichigwa muli Maandiko Matakatifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">“ ‘Nguluwi kowalajiza wahilisi wa kilanga wa heye kwa mbuli ya hegwe,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Na, ‘Wokuhola mmoko mwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">uleche kikwang'hwala magulu ga hegwe mmiganga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Yandichigwa kahi muli Maandiko Matakatifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:7">“ ‘Uleche kumjeza Mkulu, Nguluwi wa hegwe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Hamba Limazoga nalimhola Yesu na kumhilika kuli chidunda chikulu na kumlajila undewa weng'ha uli muisi. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Limazoga nalimlonjela, “Avino vyeng'ha ndokupa wone ufugamile na kinamiza kwa heni.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Aho, Yesu nakamlonjela, “Uche ahano Limazoga! Gandichigwa muli Maandiko Matakatifu. ‘Umfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi wa hegwe, na umditile heye yaliyeka.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Baho, Limazoga limleka Yesu na wahilisi wa kilanga woya kumtanza.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangwaluka mijito ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Malichi 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lukasi 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesu loyahuliche kota Yohani Mbatiza kebatigwa na kuhindilwa mchinweng'ho, nakoka kaluta Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Nakoka Nasaleti, nakaluta kikala Kapanaumu muji uli hafungo na ilamba lya Galilaya, mu mmbaka mwa wilaya za Sebuluni na Nafutali. Nakekala kuko <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>na ndo vyowenele ula ulonzi ulonjigwe na mloli Isaya.<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Isi ya Sebuluni na isi ya Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">kulutila kuli bahali mwambu ya lwanda lwa Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya, isi ya wanhu wa isi zeng'ha!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Wanhu walingikala kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">walona lumuli lukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Na hewo wekale kuli isi ya jiza na chibehelo cha kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">lumuli luwamwemwesela.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Kulawila mhela ula Yesu nakaluka kulangusa yolonga, “Mumgalamchile Nguluwi, kwa vila undewa wa kilanga wa habehi!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwachema walowa somba wane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Malichi 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lukasi 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yesu loyali yojendajenda hafungo mwa ilamba lya Galilaya, nakawona wanhu weli munhu na mng'holoze, wali walowa somba. Yumwe Simoni yachemigwe Petili hamwe na mng'holoze Andeleya wolowa somba na utandawala. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesu kawalonjela, “Mmbinze, na heni ndowaditani hemwe wavula wanhu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Baho wauleka utandawala wawo, wamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Kaluta kumwando kawona wanhu wanji weli kahi munhu na mng'holoze, wali Yakubu na Yohani wana wa Sebedayo. Awo wali wekale mitumbwi na mhaza wawo Sebedayo wowika goya utandawala wawo. Yesu kawachema. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Baho du woka wauleka aula mtumbwi hamwe na mhaza wawo, wamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulangusa na kulohola watamwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Lukasi 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesu nakakola Galilaya yeng'ha yolangusa mli ng'handa za kusalila na yodamla Mbuli Inojile ya Undewa wa Nguluwi. Na kuwosela chila matamwa gowalinago wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Mbuli nayali yodita Yesu na yenela isi yeng'ha ya Siliya, lelo wanhu wawegala wanhu weng'ha wawele watamwa na chila matamwa, wanhu wawele na chijeni, na wanhu wawele na chinzilisa na wanhu wali chete, ahyo Yesu nakawosela matamwa weng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Chilundo cha wanhu na wali womuwinza heye, kulawila Galilaya na kulawila honhu hawele na mji wa Dekapoli kulawila Yelusalemu na Yudeya na isi ili kumwambu na lwanda lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kuchemigwa kuli chidunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Yesu nakawona wanhu wenji, kakwina hali chidunda nakikalisa. Walanguswa nawamzenjelela. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Na heye kaluka kuwalangusa.<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usangalalo wa kukomya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Lukasi 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>“Wobweda kwa wawele ng'hochele mli muhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">mina undewa wa kilanga ndo wa hewo!<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Wobweda kwa walingisinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">mina Nguluwi kowasangalaza.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Wobweda kwa hewo waholile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">mina woihalila isi!<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Wobweda kwa wawele na nzala na ng'halu ya kukola gatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">mina Nguluwi kowagutiza.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Wobweda kwa wawele na isungu kwa wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">mina na heye Nguluwi kowonela isungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Wobweda kwa wawele na nhumbula zilihela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">mina womona Nguluwi.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Wobweda kwa walingigala makundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">mina wochemigwa wana wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Wobweda kwa wawele kugaya kwa kukola gatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">mina undewa wa kilanga ndo wa hewo.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Mbweda hemwe wanhu wowaliga na kuwabocheleza, na kuwasinjizila vinhu vihile, kwa mbuli ya heni. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Msangalale na kusechelela, kwa vila chonolo chompegwa chowa chikulu kilanga. Avyo ndo wawabocheleze waloli wawele bahano muisi hemwe hamnoya.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwino na lumuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Malichi 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Lukasi 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Hemwe mwa mwino wa wanhu muisi, wone mwino uwe ulihela unoni, wonojezwa na choni? Haiwa chinhu ng'hatu, ila yotajigwa kunze na kubijigwa na wanhu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Hemwe mwa lumuli lwa wanhu muisi yeng'ha! Muji uzenjigwe kuchidunda, hauchivisa hebu. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Kuduhu wanhu hawawesaga chenje na kugubika na chidoto, ila wawikaga honhu ha kuwichila chenje uwamulichila wanhu wawele mng'handa. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Vivila, iwagana wone lumuli lwenu luwe lumulika hali wanhu, leka wagone gala ganojile gomditile, wakamtogole Mhaza wa hemwe yawele kilanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso galinguwala malajizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Mleche kijesa kota mbuya kutengula malajizo ga Musa na ulanguso wa waloli. Suyile kutengula, mbuya kugomanjiza. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Ndanguwalonjela ndikomya, mbaka baho isi yeng'ha na kilanga hovikola, kuduhu ne honhu hadodo ng'hatu gandichigwe kuli malajizo hokusigwa, mbaka geng'ha genele. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Leka, yoneche yobena mzilo uli udodo kwa weng'ha, na kuwalangusa wanhu wanji wakole kota hihyo, ayo kowa mdodo ng'hatu kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi. Ila yula yobatilila na kuwalangusa wanhu wanji, heye kowa mng'hangala kuli undewa wa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Mina vyondiwalonjelani, ganojile ga hemwe wone hagawele gapulute ng'hatu kusinda gala ga Mafalisayo na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa, hamkwinjila ng'oo kuli undewa wa kilanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga kuzudila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Lukasi 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Mina muhulika kota wanhu wa katali na walonjelwa. ‘Uleche kukopola. Heye yokopola yomgana yataguswe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Ila heni ndanguwalonjelani, munhu yoneche yomzudila mng'holoze, yomlapa kutaguswa. Yalingumbeza mng'holoze, kohilikwa kwa walingutagusa. Yalingumchema mng'holoze. ‘Hegwe kwa mpoka,’ Kanguganigwa kwinjila kuli chiluli cha Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Leka, wone uhiliche nhambiko ya hegwe hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na baho ukumbuchila kota kwangilewa na mng'holozo, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>ileche nhambiko yowigale hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, uhiluche wikale na mng'holozo mihanyise gamale, ndo uhiluche kulavya nhambiko kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Mihanyise na munhu yakulonjeleze hegwe himahima muwele mnzila, wone huditile ayo, homluta honhu ha kutagusa, kokuhilika kwa mtagusa na heye kokuwika mmoko wa wamizi na hewo wokuhindila mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Ndangukulonjelani ndikomya, hulawa hebu amo, mbaka ulavye sendi ya mwiso.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso galinguwala ung'hondwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Muhulika kota wanhu na walonjelwa. ‘Mleche kudita ung'hondwa!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Ila heni ndanguwalonjela, Yomlola mdala kwa kumgana, kowa yaditile ung'hondwa mnhumbula mwa heye. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Lelo wone iziho lyako lya kudilo likudite uwifye, ling'ondole na kulitaga kutali. Igana ng'hatu kutaga chitomo chimwe mlukuli, kwa lukuli lweng'ha kwinjila kuli chiluli cha Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Wone moko wa hegwe wa kudilo, ukudite uwifye, uteme utaje kutali. Yowa goya uwe ulihela moko umwe, leka lukuli lweng'ha lwinjile kuli chiluli cha Jehanamu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso kuwala kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matei 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Malichi 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lukasi 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Na ilonjigwa nakatali kahi, ‘Yalingumleka mchewake, imgana yamwandichile kalatasi ya luleko.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Leka heni ndanguwalonjelani, wone mlume yamleche mchewake, kwa mbuli yoneche ila haiwele ya ung'hondwa kanguwifya kwa kumdita mdala yawe mng'hondwa, na munhu yoneche yomhola mdala yalechigwe, kangudita ung'hondwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso galinguwala kilaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Kahi na muhulika kota wanhu wa katali nawalonjelwa. ‘Uleche kuleka vyowilahe, udite vila vyowilahile kwa Mkulu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Leka heni ndanguwalonjela, mleche kilaha ng'hatu, haiwele kilanga, kwa vila ndo chigoda cha undewa cha Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>Haiwele kwa isi, kwa vila ndo chigoda cha heye cha kuwichila magulu, haiwele kwa Yelusalemu kwa vila ndo honhu ha mndewa mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Na uleche kilaha kwa mutwi wa hegwe, kwa vila hujeza hebu kuidita mnvili imwe iwe nzelu, ama iwe nhitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Houlonga, ‘Ena’ iwe ‘Ena,’ Na houlonga, ‘Hebu,’ Leka ng'hatu iwe ‘Hebu.’ Choneche chonjezeche kwa ago kulawa kwa ayula mwihe.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso galinguwala kihilusila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Lukasi 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Muhulika kota nailonjigwa. ‘Iziho kwa iziho na izino kwa izino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Ila heni ndanguwalonjelani, uleche kumhilusila munhu mwihe. Munhu yakuzabule izeze lya kudilo, mgalamlile kahi na lya kumoso. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Munhu yokuhilika kuli chitala yogana kukuholela igwanda lyako, mleche yahole kahi na ikoti lyako. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Munhu yokukola lupichi kidwika momholo ya heye utali wa chilomita imwe, widwiche chilomita mbili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Yokulanda umupe, na uleche kumuhinduchizila chigosi yalingugana umwaziche chinhu.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwagana wang'honyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Lukasi 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Muhulika kota vyoilonjigwe. ‘Migane lomlingikala hamwe habehi, na kumwihilwa nayali kihilwa na hegwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Leka heni ndanguwalonjela, muwagane na wang'honyo wa hemwe, na kuwalandila walinguwabocheleza hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Leka muwe wana wa Mhaza wa hemwe yawele kilanga. Heye kawaga yowamulichila lumuli awala wehile na watanganiche na kuwatowela nhonya awala wehile na watanganiche. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Hambi mopegwa chinhu chachi, kwa kuwagana walinguwagana hemwe? Kuduhu, na wakongoza sendi za kodi waditaga hiho! <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Wone mlinguwalamusa wang'holozenu yeka, ndaze, mowa mditile vinhu vya hihi hela? Na wanhu hawawele Wayahudi waditaga hiho. <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Leka muwe mtanganiche kota Mhaza wa hemwe yawele kilanga vyoyatanganiche.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Iwala kuwonela wanhu isungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Mwilolele, mleche kudita madito ganojile hali wanhu leka moneche na hewo. Lomdita hino, Mhaza wa hemwe yawele kilanga howatogola hebu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Lelo loumtanza mnzunwa, uleche kitogola hali wanhu kota wadesi vyowalingudita kuli ng'handa ya kusalila na mnzila, wopala wanhu wawatogole. Ndangulonga ndikomya, wowa wabochele chonolo cha hewo. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Ila hegwe houmtanza mnzunwa, udite ahyo kota yula yondilingumgana ng'hatu wa habehi na hegwe yaleche kuvizela choudita. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Ulavye utanzi wa hegwe kwa uviso, Mhaza wa hegwe yalingugona gavisigwe, kokutogola.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga kulanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Lukasi 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Lomlanda, mleche kudita kota wahadi. Hewo waganaga kwima na kutambichiza mng'handa ya kusalila na mfungo mwa nzila wogana wanhu wawalole. Ndangulonga ndikomya, awo mina wabochela chonolo cha hewo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Ila hegwe houlanda, winjile mchihengo na uhinde lwizi, hamba umlande Mhaza halingoneka. Na heye Mhaza wa hegwe, yalingugona gavisigwe, kokutogola.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Lomlanda, uleche kuhabuka gamwe gago kota wanhu hawamzelele Nguluwi. Hewo wangijesa kota Nguluwi kowahulichiza kwa vila wangulonga ulonzi winji. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Mleche kiwhana na hewo, Mhaza wa hemwe kovizela chomgana hala mng'hali ne kumlanda! <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Lelo ahino ndo mlinguganigwa kulanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">“ ‘Mhaza wa hetwe uwele kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">itagwa lya hegwe litogoligwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>undewa wa hegwe uye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">lyougana likoleche hano mu isi, liwe kota vyoliwele kilanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Utugalile lehano chilyo cha hetwe chotulingugana.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Utusile gala gotuwifile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">kota vila hetwe vyo tuwosele wala watuzudize.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Uleche kutwinjiza kuli kujezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Ila utulohole na yula mwihe.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">(Kwa vila undewa ndo wa hegwe, na ludali, na ukulu mbaka mazuwa gose. Ena.)<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Mina lomuwosela wanhu gehile gowaditile, Mhaza wa hemwe yawele kilanga, kowosela hemwe gehile gomditile kahi. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Ila wone mleche kuwosela wanhu wanji gehile gowaditile, na heye Mhaza, howosela hemwe gehile gomditile.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga kwesela kulya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Homukwesela kulya, mleche kudita kota wadesi, hewo wakwisukaga kumeho, wogana wanhu wawalole kota wesela kulya. Ndanguwalonjela ndikomya, kota hewo, mina wabochela chonolo cha hewo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Ila hegwe wone wesele kulya, uhovuje kumeho na ubakalize mafuta kumutwi kwa hegwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>Leka wanhu waleche kuvizela kota kwesela kulya, ila uzeleche hela na Mhaza wa hegwe halingoneka. Na heye Mhaza wa hegwe yalingona gavisigwe, kokutogola.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'hano kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Lukasi 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Mleche kiwichila lufufu hano muisi kuwele na mifukuzi na ng'angaga ili nguwifya, na wahizi wokwinjila na kuhiza. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Miwichile ng'hano kilanga kuwele kuduhu mifukuzi na ng'angaga wolemwa kuwifya, na wahizi hawokwinjila kuhiza. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Leka ahala hoiwele ng'hano ya hegwe, ndo na nhumbula ya hegwe hoiwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Lukasi 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Iziho ndo lumuli lwa lukuli. Wone iziho lyako liwe likomu, lukuli lweng'ha lowa mlumuli. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Wone iziho lyako liwe litamwa, lelo lukuli lweng'ha lowa lutitile, na wone lumuli luwele mgati mlukuli lwako, luwe kuli jiza, lelo alyo jiza lya kudumbiza ng'hatu!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi na lufufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Lukasi 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Haduhu munhu yokola mijito kwa wakulu weli. Mina komzudila yumwe na kumgana yunji, ama kowa yomhulichiza yumwe na kumbeza yunji. Howeza kumfugamila Nguluwi na lufufu.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Lukasi 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Ndanguwalonjelani hemwe, mleche kijesa kuli ukomu wa hemwe, molya choni ama monwa choni leka muwe na ukomu, ama movala choni. Ndaze, ukomu unoga kusinda chilyo na lukuli lunoga kusinda nguwo. <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Mvilole videje, havilingunyala nyhadikwa, havilingubeta nyhadikwa, kahi vyahela ng'hano. Leka ahyo Mhaza wa hemwe kilanga kanguwahombela. Lelo hemwe mnoga kusinda awo. <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Ndaze, hagati ha hemwe kuna munhu kwa mbuli ya lunhwinhwi yoweza kuhejeza ne saa imwe ya kikala mu isi?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Ndaze mwangijesa chomvala? Mlole uluwa wa kisolo vyoulingutitima! Hagalingukola chinhu choneche. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Ila ndanguwalonjelani, na heye Solomoni, na lufufu lwake lweng'ha, nahavalile goya kota uluwa umwenga kuli uluwa umwenga. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Nguluwi yalingugana mahamba gawe na mibadu, na misolo lehano jangutitima na mitondo janguvunda na kujisoma mchiluli! Ndaze, howaditilani hemwe mzidi? Hemwe wanhu muwele na makundo mado!<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Leka mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi. ‘Tolya choni? Tonwa choni? Na tovala choni?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Mina vyeng'ha vyangugailwa na wanhu hawamzelele Nguluwi. Mhaza yawele kilanga, kavizela kota mwangugana vinhu vyeng'ha avyo. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Ahyo mijeseni tandi undewa wa Nguluwi, na gala goyogana heye na ago geng'ha kowapa hemwe na vinhu viyage. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Leka, mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi na ga mitondo. Mitondo yowa na nongwa yake. Nongwa ya zuwa imwe yowatosani kwa zuwa ayo.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga kuwatagusa wanhu wanji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Lukasi 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Mleche kuwatagusa wanhu wanji, mleche namwe kutaguswa na Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Kwa vila vyomuwatagusa wanji, na hemwe namwe vyomtagusigwa hihyo na Nguluwi, chipimilo chichila cho mpimila kwa wanji, ndo Nguluwi choyopimila kwa hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Lekachoni, kwanguchona chibanzi chiwele miziho lya mng'holozo, ila uleka kuchona ching'anzi chiwele miziho lya hegwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Ama, koweza ndaze kumlonjela mng'holozo kota, ‘Mng'holozangu tandi ndikuse chibanzi chiwele miziho lya hegwe,’ Akuno nagwe uwele na ching'anzi chiwele miziho lya hegwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Kwamdesi hegwe! Use tandi chibanzi chiwele miziho lyako ndo koweza kulavya ching'anzi chiwele miziho lya mng'holozo.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Mleche kutozela mibwa vinhu vilavigwe kwa Nguluwi, waleche kugaluka na kuwalumaga. Na hihyo mleche kutozela migubi vinhu vyenu vyelile, waleche kuvibiganga.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulande na upale na udumize lwizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Lukasi 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Mlande namwe mopegwa, na mpale namwe movyona, na mhodize lwizi, namwe mochumulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Mina yoneche yolanda kopegwa, na yalingupala kachonaga na yohodiza lwizi, kochumulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Hambi kabaho yumwe mwa hemwe, wone mwana wa heye yamlande ibumunda komha iganga? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Ama, wone yalande somba, komha izoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Kota lelo hemwe, hanga lomwihile, mvizela kuwapa wana wa hemwe vinhu vinojile, ndangukomya Mhaza wa kilanga, kodita vikulu ng'hatu na kowapa ganojile awala weng'ha walingumlanda.<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Vyeng'ha vyo mlingugana wanhu wawaditileni hemwe, muwaditile hewo hiho. Ahi ndo vyogalingulonga malajizo ga Musa na malanguso ga waloli.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lwizi luzisili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Lukasi 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Mwinjile kukolela lwizi luzisili. Kwa vila nzila ilikulongoza kuli kudumigwa ngazi, na lwizi lwa kwinjilila amo lugazi, walinguluta nzila ayo wenji. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Ila nzila ilikulongoza kuli ukomu nzisili, na lwizi lwa kwinjilila amo luzisili, wanhu wachefu hela ndo woizela nzila ayo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Igodi na mafuza gake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Lukasi 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Mwilole na Waloli wa udesi. Hewo wanguya kwa hemwe wokoneka kota ming'holo kwa kunze, ila kwa mgati mibwa ja kisolo jing'hang'hale. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Mowazela kwa madito ga hewo. Ndaze, wanhu hubawaga ububu hali migodi ja miwa na misada kuli mbijili? Hebu! <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Leka, igodi linojile lilelaga mafuza ganojile, na igodi lihile lilelaga mafuza gehile. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Igodi linojile halilelaga mafuza gehile, na igodi lihile halilelaga mafuza ganojile. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Chila igodi halilingulela mafuza ganojile, wotemigwa na kutozigwa mchiluli. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Kwa hino, mowazela waloli wa udesi kwa madito ga hewo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siwazelele hemwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Lukasi 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Haiwele chila munhu yondonjela, ‘Mkulu, Mkulu’ Kokwinjila kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi, leka yula yokweneza yaganile Mhaza wa heni yawele kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Wenji wondonjela zuwa lila lya utaguso, ‘Mkulu, Mkulu! Kwa itagwa lyako natwali tulangusa usenga wa hegwe na kwa itagwa lyako tulavya vijeni na kukola vinduzanduza vinji.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Aho, ndowalonjela, ‘Nasiwazelele hemwe ng'oo, muche kumwando kwa heni, hemwe mlingudita gehile.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walinguzenga weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Lukasi 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Chila munhu yohulika gondilonga, na kugawika mnhumbula, kewhana na munhu yawele na nyhala yazenjile ng'handa hali italawe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Nhonya itowa na nzanda zimema tendemaa, mbeho iputa, kuigwisa aila ng'handa. Ila ng'handa haigwile kwa vila na izenjigwa mitalawe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Ila yoneche yalinguhulika gondilonga ne kugawika mnhumbula, kewhana na munhu mpoka yazenjile ng'handa hali sangalaza. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Nhonya itowa na nzanda zimema na mbeho iputa nakuitigasa ng'handa, nayo igwa luu! Kahi kugwa ako kwali kukulu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ludali lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesu vyoyasindile kulonga ulonzi awo, wanhu weng'ha na wamemile honhu hala nawabubuwala na ulanguso wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Hawele kota walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa, ila nakalangusa kwa ludali.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Malichi 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lukasi 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesu vyoyeduliche kuchidunda, na kawona wanhu wenji womuwinza heye. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Lelo nakoya munhu yumwe yawele na uswema, kafugama kumwando kwa heye na kulonga, “Mkulu, wone ulingugana, kombusila utamwa wondilingugula.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesu kagolola moko, kamdoliza na kulonga, “Ndangugana wezuligwe,” Bahala du munhu yula, kawa mkomu uswema umlawa. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Hamba Yesu nakamlonjela ayula munhu kata, “Ulole, uleche kumlonjela munhu yoneche, ila ulute kilajila kwa watambika wakulole kota kuwa mkomu, hamba leka wanji walavye ulolezi na hamba ulavye nhambiko kota vyoyalajize Musa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola chitumagwa wa jemadali wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Lukasi 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesu loyaliyokwinjla kuli muji wa Kapanaumu, kating'hana na mkulu wa wamizi mloma kamlutila, kamdedeza, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>yolonga, “Mkulu, chitumagwa wa heni, kawasa kaye, kazilika lukuli na kangutamika lukami.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ndokuya kumlohola.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Ayo mkulu wa wamizi Mloma nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, siganigwe winjile mng'handa ya heni. Ila ulonje ulonzi hela na chitumagwa wa heni kowa mkomu. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Mina, na heni nani, nda munhu mbele hasi ha ludali lwa wanji, ndanawo wamizi hasi ha heni. Ndangumlonjela yumwe, ‘Ulute!’ Na heye kanguluta, na yunji, ‘Uye!’ Na heye kanguya, na chitumagwa wa heni, ‘Udite chinhu chino,’ Na heye kangudita.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesu vyo yahuliche ago, na kabubuwala, na kuwalonjela wanhu wawele womuwinza heye, “Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, sinamona munhu yawele na makundo kota aga, kweng'ha Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Lelo ndanguwalonjela kota wanhu wenji wokuya kulawa kolilawila isanya na kolizinjila, na kikala hanyi hali ndiya hamwe na Abulahamu, na Isaka, na Yakubu kuli undewa wa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Ila hewo wawele kuganigwa kuli undewa awo, wotozigwa kunze kuli kutitu, ako ndo kowolila na kujejeda mizino.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Yesu na nakamlonjela ayula ofisa Mloma, “Ulute kaye na go ukundile gowa gakoleche kwa hegwe.” Na ayula chitumagwa wa heye kawa mkomu bahala.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalohola wanhu wenji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Malichi 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lukasi 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesu nakafika kaye kwa Petili, na kamfika mkweye Petili yotamika yawasile mchinhanda, yapwituche lukami. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Baho, Yesu kamdoliza yula mamo mmoko na bahala utamwa umleka, kenuka na kwaluka kuwawichila chilyo.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Vyoifichile matinazo, wanhu wawegala wanhu wenji wawele na vijeni, na heye kwa ulonzi hela, kawinga vijeni avyo. Na kawosela wanhu weng'ha matamwa ga hewo. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Nakadita hino kukomya gala goyalonjile Mloli Isaya genele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Heye yuye kauhola unghochele wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">Nakapika matamwa ga hetwe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wawele nguganigwa wawe walanguswa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Lukasi 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesu vyoyawawene chilundo cha wanhu wamkulumbile, nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye walute kumwambu kwa ilamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Mlangusa yumwe wa malajizo ga Musa kamlutila nakumlonjela, “Mlangusa, heni ndokuwinza koneche kouluta.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesu kamwidichila, “Mibwa ja kisolo jina mhalika, na videje vya kuulanga vina vimvulila, ila mwana wa munhu, kahela honhu ha kuwasiliza mutwi na kwesela.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Hamba munhu yunji, yawele mli walanguswa wa heye, nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, ung'hundize tandi ndute ndikamtile mhaza wa heni.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Ila Yesu nakamlonjela, “Umbinze heni! Waleche wabagame wawatile wayao wabagame.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguilonjela nhigu inyamalile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Malichi 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lukasi 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Yesu nakenjila mli itumbwi na wali hamwe na walanguswa. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Baho du, nhigu nailawila kilamba, nhigu yaluka kugubika itumbwi na itumbwi lyaluka kutigasika na kumema mazi. Yesu nayali yawasile ng'hatu. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Walanguswa na waluta akula koyawasile, na wamlanda wolonga, “Mkulu yawalohole na aila nhigu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesu kawalonjela, “Hemwe wanhu muwele na makundo mado, leka choni mwangudumba?” Hamba kenuka na kuilonjela aila nhigu na mbeho nayali iputa, inyamalile na inyamalila tulu. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Wanhu weng'ha na wekala wabubuwale, walonga, “Ayu munhu wachi? Nhigu na mbeho vyangumuhulika.”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalohola wanhu weli wawele na chijeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Malichi 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lukasi 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesu loyoyile kuli isi ya Wagadala, kumwambu na alila ilamba, kating'hana na walume weli walawile kuli mipalika kuwele na vilaga. Wanhu awa wali na chijeni kumutwi, chiwang'ang'aze heko mbaka wanhu wawele wodumba kukola nzila ayo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Na hewo bahala wayowa, “Kwangugana choni na hetwe, hegwe mwana wa Nguluwi?, Ndaze, kuya kutugaza mhela haunoya?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Habehi na honhu aho, kwali na migubi minji jidimwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Lelo avyo vijeni vimdedeza, “Wone ulingugana kutuwinga, utuleche twinjile kuli jila migubi.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesu kajilonjela, “Aya mlute.” Baho vijeni viwalawa wanhu wala, na kwinjila kwa migubi. Chilundo cheng'ha cha migubi jichina mnyenje na kwinjila milamba, na migubi jeng'ha jibagama.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Wadimi wa ajo migubi nawabilima, waluta kaye. Ako walavya mbuli zeng'ha loziwalawile na mbuli ziwalawile wala wanhu wawele na vijeni vihile <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Leka wanhu weng'ha wa ula muji nawalawa, wamlutila Yesu, na lowamuwene, wamlonjela yoche kuli isi ya hewo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola munhu yaziliche lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Malichi 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lukasi 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yesu nakenjila mitumbwi nakahiluka kuluga kwa heye koyalingikala, kwa kuloka ilamba. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Aho wanhu na wamigalila munhu yaziliche lukuli yawasile mchinhanda. Yesu vyoyawene makundo ga hewo, nakamlonjela yula munhu yaziliche, “Mwanangu, wikangaze, kusilwa gehile gouditile.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Wamwe wa walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa nawaluka kijesa, “Munhu ayu kangumkovula Nguluwi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesu nakavizela choni chowochijesa, kawalonjela, “Lekachoni mli na majesa gehile kuli mnhumbula za hemwe? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Lilikohi liwele ubewe ng'hatu. Kulonga, ‘Kusilwa gehile ga hegwe,’ Ama kulonga, ‘Wime ujende?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Lelo ndangugana mvizele kota Mwana wa Munhu kanao ludali muisi lwa kuwosela wanhu gehile ga hewo.” Aho nakamlonjela yula munhu yaziliche, “Winuche, uhole chinhanda cha hegwe, ulute kaye.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Ayula munhu nayaziliche nakenuka, kaluta kaye. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Wanhu weng'ha wamemile hala lowagawene ago, nawabubuwala na kudumba, na wamtogola Nguluwi kwa ludali alo loyawapele wanhu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Matei kanguchemigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Malichi 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lukasi 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesu nakoka ahala honhu, navyoyali yoluta kamona munhu yumwe itagwa lyake Matei, yekalise mchituka cha kodi. Yesu nakamlonjela, “Umbinze.” Na heye Matei kenuka, nakumuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yesu loyali mng'handa yolya chilyo, wakongoza kodi na wawele na gehile nawoya kikala hamwe na walanguswa wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Mafalisayo wamwe na lowagawene ago, wawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Lekachoni mlangusa wa hemwe kangulya hamwe na wakongoza kodi na wadita gehile?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesu nakawahulika, nakalonga, “Wanhu wawele wakomu hawalingugana mlaguzi hebu, ila awala wawele watamwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Lelo mkelanguse ulonzi awu, ‘Ndangugana isungu, haiwele nhambiko.’ Heni suyile kuwachema wanhu wala watanganiche, leka wawele na gehile.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwuza mbuli ya kwesela kulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Malichi 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lukasi 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Hamba walanguswa wa Yohani Mbatiza wamuuza, “Hetwe twangwesela kulya na Mafalisayo wangwesela kulya mala nyinji, iwa ndaze walanguswa wa hegwe hambe wesele kulya?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndaze, walalikwe kuli mnvina ya kuhesa wanguganigwa kulila kwa kulombocheza mkasano yawele baho hamwe na hewo? Hebu, Ena! Ila mhela wofika aho mkasano kokusigwa hali hewo, aho ndo wokwesela kulya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Haduhu munhu yahonelezaga nguwo nyale kuli nguwo ya katali. Mina chila chilaka chodeganga aila nguwo ya katali, na ahala hahonelezwe howa hagazi. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Na kuduhu munhu yowika divai ya lehano, kuli chizombe cha igozi cha katali. Howodita hino, achila chizombe cha igozi na divai yobohoka. Na achila chizombe chowa cha kutaga. Lelo iwaga hino, divai ya lehano, iwikagwa mli chizombe chinyale, na vyeng'ha vili, chizombe na divai vyowichigwa goya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mhinza wa ofisa na mdala yumwe wangusigwa utamwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Malichi 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lukasi 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesu loyali yolonga ago, chilongozi yumwe Myahudi nakoya, kenamiza nakulonga, “Mhinza wa heni kabagama sambi. Ila, ndangukulanda tuche ukamuwichile moko wa hegwe na heye kowa mkomu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Baho Yesu nakoka hamwe na walanguswa wa heye kamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Mdala yumwe, nayali yotamika kulawa danda katali ng'hatu, mihela kumi na mili, nakamuwinza Yesu kumbele, nakadoliza lupembo lwa nguwo ya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Nakadita ahyo kwa vila nakejesa mnhumbula. “Londidoliza hela nguwo ya heye, ndowa mkomu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesu kahinduka nakamona, nakamlonjela, “Mhinza wikangaze! Makundo ga hegwe gakulohola.” Mamo ayo kaloholigwa bahala.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Hamba Yesu na kenjila mng'handa ya yula chilongozi, loyawawene wapemba mluli mchililo na chilundo cha wanhu wolila na kulombocheza, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>Kawalonjela, “Weng'ha mlawe kunze, mhinza ayu hafile, kawasa hela.” Na hewo nawamseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Baho, chilundo cha wanhu lochilawile kunze, Yesu kenjila mng'handa, kamibata ayo mhinza moko, na heye kema. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Mbuli ayo na yenela kweng'ha mu isi ila yeng'ha.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalohola wohambe walole weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesu nakoka ahala honhu, na loyaliyoluta, wohambe walole weli nawamuwinza aku wotowa iyowe, “Mwana wa Daudi utonele isungu!” <verse eid="MAT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesu loyenjile mng'handa awala wohambe walole weli wamlutila, na heye kawauza, “Ndaze, mwangukunda kota ndoweza kuwaditilani mbuli ayo?” Na hewo wamwidichila, “Ena, Mkulu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Aho Yesu kadoliza meho gawo, nakulonga, “Na iwe kota vyomlingukunda.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Na bahala meho gawo gagubuka nawaluka kulola kahi. Yesu kawalonjela, “Mleche kumlonjela munhu yoneche mbuli ayi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Ila hewo woka, weneza mbuli ya Yesu kuli isi ila yeng'ha.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola yohambe yalonje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Wanhu lowali wokuka, wanji nawamigalila Yesu munhu yumwe yawele yohambe yalonje kwa vila nayali na chijeni. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Baho du acho chijeni lochilawile, munhu yula nayawele hambe yalonje kaluka kulonga kahi. Wanhu nawabubuwala na kulonga, “Mbuli kota ino hainalawila koneka kuli isi ino ya Isilaeli!” <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Ila Mafalisayo wawa wolonga, “Kanguwinga vijeni kwa ludali lwa mkulu wa vijeni.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwonela isungu wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesu nakajendela miji jeng'ha na vijiji, nakalangusa kuli ng'handa za kusalila za hewo yodamla Mbuli Inojile ya Undewa wa Nguluwi, yolohola matamwa geng'ha na vyeng'ha vilingugaza. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Lelo vyoyawene vilundo vya wanhu, nakawonela isungu kwa vila wali watochile na wawele na lunhwinhwi kota ming'holo jilihela mdimi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Aho nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Mbena nyinji, ila wakola mijito wachefu. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Lelo mumlande Mkulu yalajize wakola mijito wabene mbena ya heye.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Walanguswa kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Malichi 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lukasi 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu nakawachema walanguswa wa heye kumi na weli, hamwe nakuwapa ludali lwa kuwinga vijeni vihile na kuwosela wanhu matamwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Aga hano ndo matagwa ga hewo watumigwa kumi na weli, kwaluka na Simoni yochemigwa Petili na mkulugwe Andeleya na Yakubu na mkulugwe Yohani wana wa Sebedayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Na kahi Filipo na Batolomeo na Tomasi na Matei nayali mkongoza kodi na Yakubu mwana wa Alufayo na Tadei na <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simoni yalawile Kanaani na Yudasi Isikalioti yambelenhuche Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalajiza walangusa kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Malichi 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lukasi 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Awa kumi na weli nawalajizwa na Yesu kota hino, “Mleche kuluta kuli wanhu wa isi, na mleche kwinjila kuli muji wa Wasamaliya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Hemwe mlute kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli wajilile kota ming'holo. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Mlute mkawalonjele kota ‘Undewa wa kilanga wa habehi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Muwosele matamwa wanhu walingutamika, na muwahilusile ukomu wafile, muwalohole awala walingutamika kizada, na mlavye jimazoga. Mpegwa ne kulavya sendi, namwe mlavye ne kuhola sendi. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Mleche kuhola zahabu na sendi zeng'ha zila mmihako jenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Mleche kuhola mhako komluta, na igwanda linji na makwamba na ne ng'hweku ila. Wakola mijito wopegwa chowogana.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Na wone mfiche muji woneche ama chijiji, na wone munhu yowabochela, mikale baho mbaka zuwa homkuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Homkwinjila mng'handa muwalamse wenyeng'haye. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Wone wenyeng'haye wa ng'handa wanguganigwa ulamso awo, kikala goya kopona hamwe na hewo. Ila wone hawalinguganigwa, lelo kikala goya kwa hemwe kowahiluchila hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Na wone munhu yoneche yolema kuwabochela na kuwahulika, muche kuli ng'handa ayo na mkung'hune nhimbwisi iwele mmagulu ga hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, zuwa lya utaguso, heye kolajila isungu ng'hatu kwa wanhu wa Sodoma na Gomola kusinda awo wanhu wa honhu aho!<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wihe woukuya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Malichi 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Lukasi 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Mlole ndanguwalajiza hemwe kota ming'holo hali mibwa ja kisolo. Muwe wasugu kota izoka, na muwe mholile kota ng'hunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Milolele, wokuya wowebata, na kuwahilika kuli ng'handa za kutagusa na wowasubulani na ng'hobwa kuli ng'handa za kusalila. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Mohilikwa kwa vilingozi na wandewa kwa chiwalo cha heni, leka mlavye ulolezi kwa hewo na wanhu wa isi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Lelo wone wawebate, mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi kota molonga choni, na molonga ndaze, baho mopegwa choni cha kulonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Ulonzi womlonga, haulawa kwa hemwe, wolawa kwa ludali lwa heye Muhe wa Mhaza yowa yolonga mgati mwa hemwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Walume wowahilika wang'holozawo wakopoligwe, na wahaza wodita hihyo kwa wana wawo. Na wana wowagaluchila wawalelile wakopoligwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Wanhu weng'ha wawazudilani hemwe kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heni. Leka heye yokwimilila, mbaka mwiso, koloholigwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Wanhu one wawabuze wala walingikala luga lumwe, mbilimile kuli luga lunji. Ndangukomya kota hamsinda hebu kulangusa miji jeng'ha ja Isilaeli loyanghali Mwana wa Muhu hanoya.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Mlanguswa hawaga mkulu kwa mlangusa, na kuduhu chitumagwa kawaga mkulu kwa mkulu wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Lelo mlanguswa yafande kota mlangusa na chitumagwa yafande kota mkulu wa heye. Wone nawamchema mkulu wa ivyazi Belisebuli, ndaze, hawowachema wanhu wanji wa ivyazi alyo matagwa gehile lukami?<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yalikohi wa kumdumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Lukasi 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Mleche kudumba wanhu, cheng'ha chigubikwe, chowa chigubuligwe, na mbuli ya uviso, yowichigwa hazelu. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Londiwalonjelani hemwe kung'hali kutitu, mhiluchile kulonga kuli kuzelu, na mbuli lomhuliche ilonjigwa kuuviso, muilonje hazelu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Mleche kuwadumba hewo wawele kukopola lukuli, ila walingulemwela kukopola muhe. Leka hemwe iwagana ng'hatu kumdumba yula yawele kukopola lukuli hamwe na nhumbula kuli chiluli cha Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Kwa silinje imwe yougula semembe, na semembe ne imwe yogwa hasi ne kugana Mhaza wa hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Ila kwa hemwe, na mnvili zeng'ha za kumutwi mwa hemwe ziwazigwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Lelo uleche kudumba, hemwe mhega kusinda semembe wenji.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumkunda na kumbela Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Lukasi 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Chila munhu yalingulonga kwa mlomo wa heye hazelu kota heye wa heni, heni kahi ndomkunda hali Mhaza wa heni yawele kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Ila yoneche yula yombela heni hali wanhu, na heni ndombela hali Mhaza wa heni yawele kilanga.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhuli ukomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Lukasi 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Mleche kijesa kota mbuya kuwegalilani kikala goya muisi, suyile kigala kikala goya, ila ipanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Mina mbuya kuwatowaniza hagati ha munhu na mhaza wa heye, mhinza na mayake, mkasano na mkweye. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Na wang'honyo wa munhu ndo wanhu wa haluga hake.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Yawele ngumgana mhaza ama mayake kusinda yalikungana heni, silingumgana. Yalingumgana mwana ama mhinza kusinda heni, silingumgana. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Munhu wone hapichile msalaba wa heye na kumbinza, silingumgana. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Yawele ngibatilila ukomu wa heye, kouwajiliza, ila yawele nguwajiliza ukomu wa heye kwa mbuli ya heni, kowanawo.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chonolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Malichi 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Yalinguwabochelani, kangumbochela heni, na yalingumbochela heni, kangumbochela yula yanhumile. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Heye yombochela Mloli kwa vila ka Mloli kangwajiliza Uloli. Na yawele ngumbochela munhu yatanganiche kwa vila kanoga, kokwajiliza kunoga kwa heye. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, yoneche yompa yumwe wa wadodo awa chizombe cha mazi gazizime kwa vila mlanguswa wa heni, kopegwa chonolo cha heye.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Wasenga kulawila kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Lukasi 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesu loyasindile kuwalajiza walanguswa kumi na weli, nakalawa aho, kaluta kulangusa na kudamla kuli miji ja hewo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Yohani Mbatiza yawele mchinhweng'ho nakahulika mbuli ya madito ga Kilistu. Baho, nakawalajiza walanguswa wa heye, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>wamuuze, “Ndaze, hegwe ndo yula yalinguya ama tumbeteze yunji?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesu kedichila, “Mlute mkamlonjele Yohani mbuli zomlinguhulika na kuzona. <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Wawele hambe walole, wangulola, na wali chete, wangujenda, na walingugula chipata wahovujigwa, na hawalinguhulika, wanguhulika, na wabagame wanguzilipuka kuwa wakomu. Na Mbuli Inojile yangudamligwa kwa wawele wazunwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Kobweda munhu yula yawelehela majesa kwa heni.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Walanguswa wa Yohani lowali wokuka, Yesu kadamla ga Yohani kuli wanhu na kulonga, “Lomwali mluta kwa Yohani akula kugunuche, mwali kijesa momona munhu wachi? Ndaze, namgana mlyone idete litigaswa na mbeho? Hebu! <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Lelo namluta kulola munhu yalindaze, ndaze, namwali ngijesa momona munhu yavalile goya utabuli? Hebu! Wanhu walinguvala goya wekalaga mli ng'handa za wandewa. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Ila mndonjele na mluta kulola choni? Mloli? Ena, gahega kwa mloli.<verse eid="MAT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>“Ayu ndo yalingulonjigwa kuli Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">“ ‘Ulole, heni ndomigala msenga wa heni yakulongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">heye yokugololela nzila ya kukola hegwe.’<verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, wamwe mwa wana weng'ha wa wanhu, hanalawila yawele mkulu kusinda Yohani Mbatiza. Leka hino, yula yawele mdodo ng'hatu kuli undewa wa kilanga, ndo mkulu kusinda heye. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Kulawa mhela wa Yohani Mbatiza mbaka lehano, undewa wa kilanga wangugazigwa lukami, na wanhu wang'hanuche wangujeza kuusukula kwa lupichi. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Malanguso geng'ha ga waloli na malajizo mbaka mhela wa Yohani, wali ulonga mbuli mhela uno. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Wone moweza kukunda lelo, Yohani ndo Eliya, yawele nguya. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Yawele na makutu na yahuliche.<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Lelo ndouwhaniza na choni lulelo alu? Ndo kota wasongolo wekale mluga, wawa wochilonjela chilundo chimwe kwa chiyage,<verse eid="MAT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>“ ‘Tuwatowela ngoma ila hamvinile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">Twimba lwimbo lwa kulombocheza ila hamlomboleze!’<verse eid="MAT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Mina Yohani nakoya, hadile na hanwele divai, na hewo nawalonga, ‘Chijeni chimwaluka.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Mwana wa munhu, loyezile, nayali yolya na kunwa, na wanhu na walonga, ‘Mlole munhu ayu, kangulya lukami na kugala, yeganile na wakongoza kodi na wehile,’ Leka luhala lwa Nguluwi na lutanganika kwa madito ga heye.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miji ilemwele kukunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Lukasi 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Hamba Yesu nakaluka kujikalalila miji jila jikolile vinduzanduza vinji, wanhu hawamgalamchile Nguluwi kwa kugaleka gehile gowaditile. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Mane gwegwe Kolasini! Mane gwegwe Betisaida! Mina, na iwe vinduzanduza vyo mlajilwe na vikoleche Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu weng'ha na wahawele wavalile migunila na kubakala mivu kumeho, kulajila kota wagaleka gehile na kumgalamchila Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Ndangukomya, kwa hemwe, kota zuwa lya utaguso, Nguluwi kowonela isungu wanhu wa Tilo na Sidoni kusinda hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Na kwa hegwe Kapanaumu, kwangugana uguluche uliyeka kilanga? Koduliswa hasi kuli isi ya wabagame, mina kota vinduzanduza vikoleche kwa hegwe vyahakoleche kula Sodoma, muji awo wahawele ukomu mbaka lehano. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Ila ndangukulonjelani ndikomya, zuwa lya utaguso, hegwe kogazigwa ng'hatu kusinda Sodoma.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muye kwa heni mkesele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Lukasi 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Mhela awo Yesu nakalonga, “Ndangukutogola hegwe Mhaza, Mkulu wa kilanga na wa isi, mina kuwavisa wawele na luhala na nyhala mbuli zino, kuwagubulilila wana wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ena, Mhaza, kota vila vyoikunojeze.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Mhaza wa heni kamha vinhu vyeng'ha. Kuduhu ne yumwe yamzelele mwana ila Mhaza, kuduhu yamzelele Mhaza ila Mwana, na yoneche yula Mwana yogana kumgubulila. <verse eid="MAT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>Muye kwa heni hemwe mweng'ha muwele kugaya na kupapa itunyo, na ndowapa honhu ha kwesela. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Miwohe nila ya heni na milanguse kwa heni, mina heni ndina isungu na nhumbula iholile na nhumbula za hemwe zosindamala. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Kwa vila nila ya heni ya lobwalobwa na itunyo lya heni lya ubewe.” <figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Misenga mili jivalizwe nila mhela wa kulima kumgunda</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Iwala Zuwa lya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Malichi 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lukasi 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Mhela awo, Yesu loyali yokola mmigunda Zuwa lya Kwesela, walanguswa wali na nzala na waluka kubenanga miso ja uhemba wolya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Mafalisayo vyowagawene ago, na wamlonjela Yesu, “Ulole walanguswa wa hegwe, wangudita mbuli zohambe zikundigwe kudita Zuwa lya Kwesela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndaze, hamsomile vyoyakolile Daudi loyali na nzala heye na wayage. <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Heye nakenjila mng'handa ya Nguluwi na kulya jila mibumuda ja nhambiko jiwichigwe helile ha Nguluwi. Heye ne awo wayage hambe wakundigwe kulya mibumunda ajo ila watambika waliyeng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Ama ndaze, hamsomile kuli chitabu cha malajizo ga Musa kota, Zuwa lya Kwesela, watambika wawifyaga kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, na hawalingijesa kota wawifya? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Lelo ndanguwalonjelani kuta hano hana chikulu kusinda Ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Wone na muwe mvizelele ulonzi uno, ‘Ndangugana isungu haiwele nhambiko,’ Na mwahawataguse kwa wihe wanhu walihela nongwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Mina Mwana wa Munhu ndo Mkulu kana ludali na Zuwa lya Kwesela”.<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yawele na moko ung'ong'onale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Malichi 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lukasi 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesu na koka aho, nakenjila mng'handa ya kusalila ya hewo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Kwali na munhu yawele na moko ung'ong'onale. Lelo wanhu nawamuuza Yesu, “Ndaze, yowa goya kulohola wanhu Zuwa lya Kwesela?” Na wamuuza hino wagana wamibate ha kumtagusila.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Ila Yesu nakawalonjela, “Yalikohi hali hemwe, yawele na ing'holo lila linjile mlikulubila. Ndaze, homibata na kumlavya amo Zuwa lya Kwesela? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Ila, munhu kahega kusinda ing'holo! Lelo iwa goya kudita ganojile Zuwa lya Kwesela?” <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Hamba nakamlojela ayula munhu, “Ugolole moko wa hegwe.” Nakaugolola, nawo uwa mkomu ng'hatu kota ula uyage. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Lelo Mafalisayo na walawa kunze, waluka kupwepwa ndaze vyowomkopola Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chitumagwa yahaguligwe na Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Ila Yesu loyavizelele mbuli ayo, nakalawa honhu hala. Wanhu wenji nawamuwinza, nakawalohola watamwa weng'ha, <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>nakawalemeza waleche kuwalonjela wanhu mbuli za heye, <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>leka gala goyalonjile mloli Isaya genele.<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Mlole chitumagwa wa heni yondimhagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">ndimganile heni yawele ngunojeza mnhumbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Ndowika muhe wa heni kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">na heye kodamla utaguso wa heni kuli isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Holema hebu, na hotowa iyowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">na lizi lya heye haluhulikwa kuli nzila.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Hobena hebu idenje lifinangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">na hoputa hebu utambi ulingufung'ha iyosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mbaka youdita utaguso unojile ulongoze.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Kwa heye isi zeng'ha zochitumbila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mkulu wa limazoga Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Malichi 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lukasi 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Aho wanhu wamigala munhu yawele yohambe yalole na yawele yolemwela kulonga kwa vila nayali na chijeni. Yesu kamlohola ayula munhu na baho kaluka kulonga na kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Wanhu weng'ha wamemile ahala nawabubuwala na kulonga, “Ndaze, yowa ayu ndo Mwana wa Daudi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Ila Mafalisayo lowahuliche ago, walonga, “Munhu ayu kangulavya vijeni kwa ludali lwa Belisebuli mkulu wa vijeni.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesu, yawele yavizelele majesa ga hewo, kawalonjela, “Undewa woneche ugawanuche vilundo vilingitwanza, haulingikala hebu, na mji woneche ama nhanzi yoneche igawanuche vilundo vilingilewa, vyosumigwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Wone Limazoga limuwinga Limazoga, lyangilemela liliyeka. Lelo undewa wa heye wokwimaze? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Wone heni ndilingulavya vijeni kwa ludali lwa Belisebuli, lelo wala vitumagwa wa hemwe walavyaga vijeni kwa ludali lwani, lwa Limazoga? Hebu! Ahyo, vitumagwa wa hemwe wokunda kuwatagusa hemwe kota mwiha. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Ila wone heni ndanguwinga vijeni kwa ludali lwa Muhe wa Nguluwi, lelo mvizele kota Undewa wa Nguluwi mina ukuyilani hemwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Ama, koweza ndaze munhu kwinjila mng'handa ya munhu yawele na mong'ho na kumsukula lufufu lwa heye, ne kwaluka kumuwoha ayo munhu yawele na mong'ho? Aho ndo koweza kumsukula lufufu lwa heye.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Yoneche hambe yebande na heni, kangundema, na yoneche hambe yekungajize hamwe na heni, kangusambalula. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Kwa mbuli ayo, ndanguwalonjelani, wanhu wokusilwa gehile na ukovuzi wa hewo weng'ha, ila hawokusilwa wihe wa kumkovula Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Kahi, yawele ngulonga ulonzi wa kumkovula Mwana wa Munhu kolechigwa, ila yula yawele ngulonga ulonzi wa kumlemela Muhe Yelile, hokusilwa hebu, iwe kuli isi ino, ama kuli isi ikuya.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Igodi na mafuza gake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Lukasi 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Mdite igodi liwe linojile na mafuza gake gowa ganojile, mdite uwe wihile na mafuza gake gowa gehile. Igodi lizelekaga kwa mafuza gake. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Hemwe ulelo wa izoka! Molonga ndaze mbuli zinojile hanga hemwe mli na wihe? Mina munhu hulongaga kwa gala gamemile mnhumbula. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Munhu yalinaisungu hulavyaga mbuli zinojile kuli ng'hano za heye zinojile, na munhu yehile hulavyaga mbuli zihile kuli ng'hano ya heye yihile.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Lelo ndanguwalonjelani, zuwa lya utaguso wanhu woganigwa kwidichila mbuli ya chila ulonzi wihile walingulonga. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Mina kwa ulonzi wa hegwe kokundigwa kuwa kutanganika, na kwa ulonzi wa hegwe kotagusigwa kuna nongwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugana ulajilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Malichi 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Lukasi 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Hamba wamwe wa walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo nawamlonjela Yesu, “Mlangusa, twangugana kuwona ulajilo kulawa kwa hegwe.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Na heye kawedichila, “Lulelo lwihile lulingulema kumkunda Nguluwi!” Mwangugana ulajilo, hampegwa ulajilo ila ulajilo wa mloli Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Kota vila Yona loyekale mazuwa gadatu kubunguzuka mbaka kuswa mmunda mwa Nyangumi, ndo vyoiwa kwa Mwana wa Munhu yochikala hasi mazuwa gadatu kubunguzuka mbaka liswa. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Wanhu wa Ninawi wolawila mhela wa kutagusigwa kwa wihe, na hewo wochitagusa chilelo achi kota china wihe. Mina Waninawi nawamgalamchila Nguluwi kwa mbuli ya kudamla kwa Yona, na hano hana chikulu kusinda Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Malikiya wa kusini kulawila mhela lulelo awu houtagusigwa kwa wihe, na heye kochitagusa kota china wihe. Mina heye nakajenda kulawa isi ya kutali, nakuya kuhulichiza ulonzi wa luhala wa Solomoni, na hanga hano kuwele na chikulu kusinda Solomoni.<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka kwa chijeni chihile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Lukasi 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Chijeni chihile lochiwinjigwa kwa munhu, chibemelaga kugunuche chipala honhu ha kwesela, chilemwela. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Ahi chochilonjelela, ‘Ndohiluka kaye kondawile.’ Ila lochihiluka na kuhafika hazelu halihela chinhu na kunoligwa, <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>vilutaga kuvihola vijeni viyage saba, vihile kusinda heye, na weng'ha huyaga kumwinjila ayo munhu. Na munhu ayu huwaga yagaziche lukami kusinda aho hamwande. Ndo vyoiwa kwa lulelo alu lwihile.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ivyazi ng'hatu lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Malichi 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lukasi 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yesu nayali yang'hali yolonga na chilundo cha wanhu mhela mayake na wang'holoze lowoyile na kwima hanze, nawagana kulonga na heye. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Lelo munhu yumwe nakamlonjela, “Mayako na wang'holozo wa kunze, wangugana kulonga na hegwe.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Ila Yesu kamwidichila munhu ayo, “Mayangu yalikohi? Na wang'holozangu ndo walikohi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Hamba kaugolola moko wa heye kwa walanguswa wa heye, nakulonga, “Awa ndo mayangu na wang'holozangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Mina yoneche yalingudita vyoyogana Mhaza wa heni nayali kilanga, ayo ndo mng'holozangu, na lumbulyangu, na mayangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga mnyalaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Malichi 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lukasi 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Zuwa lilila, Yesu nakalawa ila ng'handa, kaluta na kikalisa hafungo mwa ilamba na kulangusa. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Chilundo chikulu cha wanhu nachimzunguluta mbaka Yesu kakwina mli itumbwi, kekalisa. Wanhu weng'ha nawema mnyhenje ya ilamba, <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>na heye Yesu nakawalonjela mbuli nyinji kwa nhelo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Mhulichize! Mnyalaji nakaluta kunyala nyhadikwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Loyali yonyala nyhadikwa, zinji nazigwa mnzila, videje vyuya nakulya. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Zinji nazigwa hali maganga hawele hela misanga minji. Zota himahima kwa vila misanga jali michefu. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Isanya lolulawile, zikala kwa vila nzabi zalihela mong'ho, zikoboka. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Zinji nazigwa hali migodi ja miwa, miwa jikula nakuzipilinjila. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Nyhadikwa zinji nazigwa hali misanga jinojile, zota, nazilela lukami, nyhadikwa zinji mala miya, nyhadikwa zinji mala makumi sita, na nyhadikwa zinji mala makumi gadatu.” <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Yesu nakasindila kwa kulonga, “Yawele na makutu ga kuhulika na yahuliche!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liwalile Yesu kulonga kwa nhelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Malichi 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lukasi 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Walanguswa wa heye wamlutila, wamuuza, “Lekachoni kwangulonga na wanhu kwa nhelo?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Yesu kawedichila, “Hemwe mpegwa kuvizela uviso wa undewa wa kilanga, ila hewo hebu. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Mina, munhu yawele na chinhu kopegwa nakonjezelwa, ila munhu yalihela chinhu, na chila choyawele nacho choholigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Ndo mina ndangulonga na hewo kwa nhelo, kwa vila wangulola ila hawalingona, wanguhulichiza ila hawalinguhulika, ne kuvizela. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Kwa hewo genela gala yalonjile mloli Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">“ ‘Kuhulika mohulika, ila homvizela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Kulola molola, ila hamkona hebu.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Mina nyhala za wanhu awa zibowala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">wagadinya makutu gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">wadinya meho gawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Hanga, wahalolile kwa meho gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">wahahuliche kwa makutu gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">wahavizelele kwa nyhala zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na kungaluchila, kangulonga Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na heni ndahawalohole.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>Yesu nakalonga kahi, “Mobweda hemwe, mina meho genu gangulola na makutu genu ganguhulika. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, waloli na wanhu wanji watanganiche nawagana kugona gala gomlingugona, hawagawene, na kuhulika gala gomhuliche hemwe, hawagahuliche.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso gawhanile na mnyalaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Malichi 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lukasi 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Lelo hemwe milanguse nhelo ayi ya mnyalaji. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Yoneche yalinguhulika ulonzi wa mbuli ya Undewa wa Nguluwi kahulika ila havizelele, ndo kota zila nyhadikwa zigwile mnzila, Mwihe huyaga na kusukula chila chinyaligwe mnhumbula ya heye. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Ayila nyhadikwa ilagale hali italawe ndo kiwhana na munhu yahuliche usenga awo na baho kanguubochela kwa usangalalo. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Ila halilingwinjila mgati mwa hewo, hulutilila kibatilila usenga awo hado hela, na mhela wa kugaya ama nongwa hovilawila kwa mbuli ya usenga awo, kangugozola baho. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Ayila nyhadikwa ilagale hagati ha migodi ja miwa, ndo kiwhana na munhu yalinguhulika awo usenga, ila lunhwinhwi wa isi ino na uvedelo wa lufufu hubananga usenga awo, na heye halingulela mafuza. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Aila nyhadikwa ilagale hali misanga jinojile ndo kiwhana na munhu yalinguhulika ulonzi awo na kuuzela, nayo hulela, imwe mala miya, yinji mala makumi sita na yinji mala makumi gadatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana na misolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesu kawalonjela wanhu nhelo yinji, “Undewa wa kilanga uwhana kota hino. Munhu yanyalile nyhadikwa inojile kuli mgunda wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Ila hamihe imwe wanhu lowali wawasile, mwihe wa heye nakoya, kanyala misolo hagati ha uhemba, koka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Lelo nyhadikwa loyotile na kwaluka kubahula, misolo najo najaluka koneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Vitumagwa wa yula yawele na mgunda wamlutila, wamlonjela, ‘Mkulu, nahaunyalile nyhadikwa inojile kuli mgunda wa hegwe. Lelo misolo jilawa kohi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Heye nakawedichila, ‘Mwihe ndo yaditile ahyo.’ Lelo vitumagwa wa heye wamuuza, ‘Ndaze, kwangugana tuche tukajing'umbule?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Na heye kawedichila, ‘Hebu, mleche baho homkungajiza misolo, mong'umbula na uhemba kahi. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Mleche vikule hamwe mbaka mhela wa mbena. Mhela awo ndowalonjela walingubeta, mkungajize tandi misolo mjiwohe chilundochilundo cha kugasoma. Ila uhemba mukungajize mkauwiche kung'hano ya heni.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwhanile na nyhadikwa ndodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Malichi 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lukasi 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yesu nakawalonjela nhelo yinji, “Undewa wa kilanga wangiwhana na munhu yanyalile nyhadikwa ndodo ng'hatu kuli mgunda wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Yiyo nyhadikwa ndodo ng'hatu, ila wone yote, iwaga igodi likulu kusinda migodi jeng'ha. Na videje vya kuulanga vyuyaga kuzenga vimvulila mli mitagala jake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwhanile na nhungo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Lukasi 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Yesu na kalutilila kuwalonjele nhelo yinji, kalonga, “Undewa wa kilanga ufanda kota hino. Mdala yumwe nakahola nungo kahanza na utimbo vijemo vili, mbaka utimbo weng'ha ufuluma.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulangusa kwa kiwhaniza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Malichi 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesu nayali yolangusa wanhu weng'ha na kuwalonjela vinhu vyeng'ha kwa nhelo. Na nayali hambe yalonje chinhu kwa hewo ne kulonga kwa nhelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Na kadita hino, leka kweneza agala gowalonjile waloli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ndolonga na hewo kwa nhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">ndogawika hazelu gavisigwe kulawa kulumbigwa kwa isi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangugubula kiwhana kwa misolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Hamba Yesu nakawalaga wala wanhu, nakwinjila mng'handa. Walanguswa wa heye wamhejelela, wamlonjela, “Tutang'hulile nhelo ayi ya misolo yangutulangusa choni?”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Yesu kawalonjela, “Yanyalile zila nyhadikwa zinojile ndo Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Mgunda ndo isi, na nyhadikwa inojile ndo wanhu woyile kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi, na misolo ndo wanhu walutile kwa Limazoga. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Na mwihe yanyalile misolo ndo Limazoga na mbena ndo kuduma kwa ukulu na wabetaji ndo wahilisi wa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Kota vila misolo vyojilingukungajizwa hamwe na kusomigwa mchiluli, ndo vyoiwa kuduma kwa mhela. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Mwana wa Munhu kowalajiza wahilisi wa kilanga wa heye wawawiche hamwe kuli undewa wa heye wala weng'ha wali ngwambuza gehile, na weng'ha walingudita gehile. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Wahilisi wowatoza kuli ivuche lya chiluli, na ako wolila na kujejeda mizino. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Hamba, wala watanganiche wong'ala kota isanya kuli undewa wa Mhaza wa hewo. Yawele na makutu nayahuliche!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana na ng'hano ivisigwe kumgunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Undewa wa kilanga uwhana na chinhu chivisigwe kuli mgunda. Munhu yumwe kachivibula, kachivisa kahi. Nakasangalala ng'hatu leka kaluta kuguza geng'ha goyawele nago, nakuzagula mgunda ula.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana na Lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Kahi, undewa wa kilanga uwhana na mguzavinhu yumwe nayali yopala lulu inojile, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>loyapatile lulu imwe ya sendi nyinji ng'hulu, nakaluta, nakaguza geng'ha goyawele nago, nakagombola lulu ila.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana na utandawala wa somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Kahi, undewa wa kilanga uwhana na utandawala utozigwe kuli bahali, wibata somba za nhanzi nyinji ng'hatu. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Loumemile, wanhu nawaukwega hafungo, wekala, wahagula somba zinojile wawika mgati mli vidoto vyawo, na wehile wawataga. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Ndo vyoiwa kuduma kwa mhela, wahilisi wa kilanga wolawila, wowabagula wanhu wehile na wanhu watanganiche, <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>na kuwataga awo wehile kuli ivuche lya chiluli. Ako wolila na kujejeda mizino.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso gasambi na gakatali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Yesu kawauza, “Ndaze, mvizela mbuli azi zeng'ha?” Nawamwidichila, “Ena.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Heye nakawalonjela, “Leka ahyo, chila mlangusa wa malajizo ga Musa yalinguwa mlanguswa wa undewa wa kilanga kangiwhana na nayali na ng'handa yalingulavya kuli ng'hano ya heye vinhu vinyale na vya katali.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulemigwa ako Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Malichi 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lukasi 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesu loyasindile kulonga nhelo azo, nakoka honhu aho, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>kaluta kuli chijiji cha hakaye hake. Ako kawa yowalangusa wanhu kuli ng'handa za kusalila za hewo mbaka wabubuwala, walonga, “Ayu kaupata kohi luhala alu na kohi koyapeligwe ludali lwa kudita vinduzanduza avi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Ndaze, ayu hawele yula mwana wa selemala? Ndaze, mayake hawele nguchemigwa Maliya? Na wakulugwe achina Yakubu na Yusufu na Simoni na Yudasi? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Na walumbuze ndaze, hawawele hamwe na hetwe? Lelo kagapata kohi aga geng'ha?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Lelo wawa namajesa na heye. Ila Yesu kawalonjela, “Mloli halekaga kutogoligwa, ila kuli isi ya heye na hakaye hake!” <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Leka ahyo, haditile vinduzanduza vinji hala kwa vila lowalemile kukunda ga heye.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kukopoligwa kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Malichi 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lukasi 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Mhela awo Helodi mndewa wa Galilaya nakahulika lutogo lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Lelo kawalonjela vitumagwa wa heye, “Munhu ayu ndo Yohani Mbatiza, kazilipuka kulawa kowabagame, ndo mina ludali lwa vinduzanduza lwangukola mijito mgati mwake.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Helodi ndo heye yakundize Yohani yebatigwe na kuwohigwa na ng'weso na kumuwika mchinweng'ho kwa mbuli ya Helodiya, mdala wa Filipo, mng'holoze. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Chambuzo ndo kota vila Yohani loyali yamlonjele Helodi, “Haiwa goya hebu hegwe kumhola Helodiya!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Helodi nakagana yamkopole Yohani, ila nakadumba Wayahudi kwa vila nawamona Yohani ndo mloli.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Kuli mnvina ya kukumbuchila kuvumbuka kwa heye Helodi, mhinza wa Helodiya nakavina hali wajenzi. Helodi nakanojezwa, <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>mbaka kelaha kompha ayo mhinza choneche choyolanda. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Na heye, aku yohajizwa na mayake, nakalanda, “Umhe sambi baha mchisaye mutwi wa Yohani Mbatiza.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Mndewa nakesinza, ila kwa mbuli ya kula kilaha koyelahile na kwa mbuli ya wala wajenzi walalikwe, kalajiza yapegwe chila choyalandile. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Lelo Helodi nakamlajiza munhu kuchinweng'ho yamdumule mutwi Yohani. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Mutwi wa heye wigaligwa kuli chisaye, nawamha yula mhinza, na heye kamhilichila mayake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Walanguswa wa Yohani nawoya, wauhola mtufi wa heye, wautila. Hamba wamhilichila nguto Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwapa chilyo wanhu wenji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malichi 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lukasi 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesu loyahuliche mbuli ayo, nakoka honhu hala kwa itumbwi, nakaluta honhu hanji hawele hela wanhu. Ila wanhu nawahulika mbuli, wamuwinza kwa magulu kulawa mujini. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Lelo loyeduliche kumwani, nakona lung'hongola lwa wanhu, nakawonela isungu, kawosela matamwa watamwa wa hewo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Loifichile matinazo, walanguswa wa heye wamlutila wamlonjela, “Honhu aha twa kisolo, na saa za nemisi zipuluta. Lelo uwalaje wanhu walute kuli vijiji wakagombole chilyo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yesu nakawalonjela, “Haiwaganile kuluta, muwape hemwe chilyo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Ila hewo nawamlonjela, “Twanajo mibumunda jihano na somba mbili hela.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndigalileni hano.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Nakawalonjela wanhu wekalise hali misolo. Hamba Yesu kaihola jila mibumunda na somba mbili, kalola kuchanya kilanga, katambichiza. Kahi kamogola ajo mibumunda, kawapa walanguswa wa heye, na hewo wawapa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Wanhu weng'ha nawalya, weguta. Hamba walanguswa wakungajiza upumunizo, wamemeza vidoto kumi na vili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Weng'ha wadile wali walume wafichile elufu zihano, ne kuwaza wadala na wana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangujenda mchanya mmazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Malichi 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Baho, Yesu nakawalajiza walanguswa wa heye wakwine mli itumbwi, wamlongole kumwambu mwa ilamba mhela heye yowalaga wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Loyewelajile wanhu, kakwina kuchidunda nayali yeka kulanda. Loiwele nemisi, heye nayali ako yaliyeng'ha, <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>na mhela awo lila itumbwi nalyali kutali na misanga nalifika habehi na hagati mwa ilamba, ila nalyali ligaya kwa vila mbeho nayali iuhilusa. <verse eid="MAT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Nechilo, behi na kubwemwenzuka, Yesu nakawawinza walanguswa yojenda mchanya mmazi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Walanguswa wa heye lowamuwene yojenda mchanya mmazi nawadumba ng'hatu, nawalonga, “Idimu!” Nawatowa iyowe kwa kudumba. <verse eid="MAT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Baho, Yesu nakalonga na hewo, “Msindamale, nda heni. Mleche kudumba!” <verse eid="MAT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Petili nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, wone uli hegwe, undajize njende mchanya mmazi mbuye kwa hegwe.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesu nakalonga, “Ena uye.” Lelo Petili nakadulika kulawa kuli lila itumbwi, nakajenda mchanya mmazi, nakamlutila Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Ila loyawene ila mbeho, nakadumba, nakaluka kudidimila, nakalila kwa lizi lya kuchanya, “Mkulu, undohole.” <verse eid="MAT 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Aho, Yesu nakagolola moko wa heye, kamibata na kumlonjela, “Hegwe uli na makundo mado! Lekachoni waliudumba?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Hamba nawakwina mli itumbwi, na mbeho inyamalila. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Weng'ha nawawele mgati mwa itumbwi nawamfugamila, walonga, “Tukomya hegwe ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalohola watamwa Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Malichi 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Nawaloka ilamba, nawafika isi ya Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Wanhu wa ako lowamzelele, weneza mbuli heng'ha kuli honhu hala. Baho, nawamigalila Yesu watamwa weng'ha, <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>nawamlanda wawakundile wadolize hela lupembo lwa nguwo ya heye. Na hewo weng'ha wadolize waloholigwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga wasekulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Malichi 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Hamba Mafalisayo na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa woya kulawa Yelusalemu, wamlutila Yesu, wamuuza, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Lekachoni walanguswa wa hegwe hawalingudumba malanguso tubochele kwa wasekulu wa hetwe? Hawalinguhovuga moko goya kota vila vyoilinguganigwa!” <verse eid="MAT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Lekachoni namwe hamlingudumba malajizo ga Nguluwi ila mwanguganilila gombochele hemwe? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Nguluwi nakalonga, ‘Wahulichize mhaza na mayako,’ kahi ‘Nayalingumliga mhaza wa heye ama mayake, imgana yakopoligwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Ila hemwe mwangulangusa kota wone munhu yawe na chinhu choyaganile kumtanza mhaza wa heye ama mayake, ila nakulonga, ‘Nhambiko ayi ndimlavila Nguluwi,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Lelo halinguganigwa kahi kumfugamila mhaza wa heye! Ndo vyomlingubeza ulonzi wa Nguluwi kwa kuwinza malanguso ga hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Hemwe wahadi! Isaya nakalagula vinojile ng'hatu kwa hemwe.<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>“Nguluwi nakalonga, ‘Wanhu awa wangufugamila kwa ulonzi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">ila mnhumbula mwao wa kutali na heni.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Kufugamila kwa hewo kwiha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">mina wangulangusa mbuli za wanhu kota malajizo ga Nguluwi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zilingumdita munhu wavu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Malichi 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Yesu nakauchema lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu, nakawalonjela, “Mhulichize, mvizele! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Chinhu chilingumdita munhu wavu hachiwele chila chilingwinjila mgati, ila chila chilingulawa mgati. Acho ndo chilingumdita munhu wavu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Hamba walanguswa wamlutila, wamlonjela, “Ndaze, kuvizela kota Mafalisayo nawazudizwa lowahuliche ulonzi wa hegwe?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Ila heye nakawedichila, “Chila chotile chohachinyaligwe na mhaza wa heni yawele kilanga, wong'humbuligwa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Muwaleche hewo wawo! Hewo hawalingulola, vilongozi wa hawalingulola, na wone halingulola yamlongoze halingulola, weng'ha weli wokwinjila mli ikulubila. <verse eid="MAT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Petili nakalonga, “Ututanghulile ayo nhelo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesu nakalonga, “Leka na hemwe hamlinguvizela? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Ndaze, hamvizelele kota chila chilingwinjila hamlomo changuluta kumunda na hamba kulawa kunze kucholo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Ila mbuli zilingulawa kumlomo hulawaga mnhumbula, na ago ndo galingumdita munhu yawe mwavu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Mina mnhumbula mlawaga majesa ga kukopola na ung'hondwa na uhonzolomo na uhizi na ulonzi wa uhadi na kukovula. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Ago ndo galingumdita munhu wavu. Ila kulya ndiya ne kuhovuga moko hamditile munhu yawe mwavu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makundo ga mdala yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Malichi 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesu nakoka honhu hala nakaluta kikala kuli honhu ha Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Lelo mdala yumwe yawele Mkanaani wa isi ayo kamuyila, kakwiniza lizi kalonga, “Mkulu, Mwana wa Daudi, umbonele isungu. Mhinza wa heni kangugazigwa na chijeni chihile.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Ila Yesu nahamwidichile. Lelo walanguswa wa heye wamlutila, wamlonjela, “Mlonjele yoche kwa vila kangutuwinzawinza yotowa iyowe.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesu nakamwidichila, “Situmigwe ila kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli wajilile kota ming'holo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Ahyo yula mdala nakoya, kamfugamila, nakulonga, “Mkulu unhanze.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yesu nakamwidichila, “Hainojile kuhola chilyo cha wana na kutozela mibwa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Ahyo mdala nakamwidichila, “Ndangukomya, Mkulu, ila na mibwa najo jilyaga usanyangwa ulingulagala kuchisaga.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesu nakamwidichila, “Mdala, makundo ga hegwe makulu, lelo uditilwe kota vyoulingulanda.” Yula mhinza wa heye kawa mkomu bahala.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalohola wanhu wenji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu nakalawa aho kaluta hafungo mwa ilamba lya Galilaya, nakakwina mchidunda, kekalisa. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Wanhu wenji lukami nawamuyila womigalila waziliche lukuli, wohambe walole, wali chete, wohambe walonje, na wanji wenji wowawele watamwa, nawawawika hamwando hali magulu, na heye nakawosela matamwa ga hewo. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Lung'hongola lwa wanhu naububuwala ng'hatu louwene wala hanawalingulonga, wangulonga na wala nawaziliche lukuli wawa wakomu na wala walichete wangujenda na wohambe walole, wangulola na wanhu nawamtogola Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwapa chilyo wanhu elufu zine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Malichi 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Lelo Yesu kawachema walanguswa wa heye, nakalonga, “Ndanguwonela isungu wanhu awa kwa vila wali baha na heni kwa mazuwa gadatu, na sambi wahela chilyo. Siviganile walute ne kulya, waleche kuzilika mnzila.” <verse eid="MAT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Walanguswa nawamlonjela, “Hano twa kisolo, topata kohi chilyo cha kuhega kwa wanhu weng'ha awa?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesu nakawauza, “Mwanajo mibumunda jilinga?” Nawamwidichila, saba na tusomba tuchefu. <verse eid="MAT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Lelo Yesu nakawalonjela wanhu wekalise hanyi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Kahola jila mibumunda saba na tula tusomba, kamtogola Nguluwi, kavimogola, kawapa walanguswa, na hewo wawagawila wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Weng'ha walya, weguta. Hamba walokoteza upumunizwa, wamemeza vidoto saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Awo wadile wali walume elufu zine, ne kuwaza wadala na wana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Lelo Yesu nakawalaga wanhu, nakakwina mli itumbwi, nakaluta honhu kulinguchemigwa Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangugana ulajilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Malichi 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Lukasi 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Mafalisayo na Masadukayo nawamlutila Yesu, na kwa kumjeza, wamlanda yawalajile ulajilo kulawa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Ila Yesu nakawedichila, “Hoifika matinazo hemwe mlongaga, ‘Luhela lowa lunojile kwa vila kilanga kudung'uwala.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Na lufuku mwangulonga, ‘Lehano nhonya yotowa, kwa vila kuulanga kudung'uwala na ng'hungugu igubika.’ Lelo hemwe mvizela ng'hatu kuwaza luhela kwa kulola kilanga vyokuli, ila kuvizela ulajilo wa luhela loza kuwa ndaze hamvizelele. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Lulelo lwihile lulingulema kumkunda Nguluwi! Lwangugana ulajilo, hachipegwa ulajilo woneche ula, ila ulajilo wa Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Lelo kawaleka, kaluta.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usaso wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Malichi 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Walanguswa wa heye lowalochile kumwambu mwa ilamba, wefika wasemwa kuhola mibumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesu kawalonjela, “Milole na muwe meho na usaso wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Ila hewo wawa wochilonjelela, “Kangulonga hino kwa vila hatuholile mibumunda.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesu nakagazela majesa gawo, kawalonjela, “Hemwe wanhu muli na makundo mado! Ndaze mwangilonjelela kwa mbuli ya vyomlihela mibumunda? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Ndaze, mng'hali kuvizela? Ndaze, hamlingukumbuka londimogole ajila mibumunda jihano kwa chiwalo cha wanhu elufu zihano? Ndaze, na mmemeza vidoto vilinga vya upumunizo? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Ama, ajila mibumunda saba jowapegwe wala wanhu elufu zine, ndaze, nammemeza vidoto vilinga vya upumunizo. <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Hambi hamlinguvizela kota sali ndilonga kwa mbuli ya mibumunda? Mwilole na usaso wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Ahyo walanguswa na wavizela kota nakawalonjela welole haiwele usaso wa mibumunda, ila na malanguso ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangukunda kota Yesu ka mwana wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Malichi 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lukasi 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesu loyafichile nzingo ya Kaisalia Filipo, nakawauza walanguswa wa heye, “Wanhu wangulonga Mwana wa Munhu ka whaani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Nawamwidichila, “Wanji wangulonga hegwe ndo Yohani Mbatiza, wanji wangulonga hegwe ndo Eliya, na wanji wangulonga hegwe ndo Yelemiya ama yumwe wa waloli.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yesu nakawauza, “Na hemwe ndaze, mwangulonga heni nda whaani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simoni Petili nakedichila, “Hegwe ndo Kilistu Mlohozi, Mwana wa Nguluwi yawele mkomu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu nakalonga, “Kubweda hegwe Simoni mwana wa Yona,” “Kwa vila hawele munhu yakugubulile mbuli ino, ila Mhaza wa heni yawele kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Na heni ndangukulonjela, hegwe ndo Petili, na hali italawe alino ndokwimiza chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu cha heni, na mong'ho wa kubagama hauweza kuusumya. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Ndokupa chichumulilo cha undewa wa kilanga, chila chouhinda muisi, chohindigwa kilanga na chila chouchumula muisi, chochumuligwa kilanga.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Hamba nakawalemeza walanguswa waleche kumlonjela munhu yoneche kota heye ndo Kilistu Mlohozi.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga mbuli ya kugaya na kubagama kwa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Malichi 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lukasi 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Kulawa mhela awo Yesu nakaluka kuwalonjela walanguswa wa heye ne kuvisa, “Ndanguluta Yelusalemu, na ako wakulu, watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa, wongaza ng'hatu. Wong'hopola ila zuwa lya kadatu, ndozilipuka.” <verse eid="MAT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Aho Petili kamhola Yesu hafungo, nakaluka kumng'hanuchila, “Uleche kulonga hino Mkulu! Mbuli ayi haikufika hebu!” <verse eid="MAT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Ila Yesu kahinduka, nakamlonjela Petili, “Uche kumwando kwa heni, Limazoga! Hegwe ndo ngwamo kwa heni. Majesa ga hegwe hagawele ga chinguluwi ila ga chiwunhu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Munhu yoneche yogana kumbinza heni, imgana yeleme yuye, yahole msalaba wa heye, yambinze. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Mina, munhu yogana kuulohola ukomu wa heye yuye, kouwajiliza. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Ila munhu yokwajiliza ukomu wa heye kwa mbuli ya heni, kogapata. Ndaze, munhu kowa na choni chinojile wone koihaliza isi yeng'ha hanga youkwajiliza ukomu wa heye? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Mana, Mwana wa Munhu kokuya kuli ukulu wa Mhaza wa heye hamwe na wahilisi wa kilanga wa heye, na ahyo ndo chila munhu kopegwa kota vyoyaditile. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, wowa wanji bahano hawobagama wang'hali kumona Mwana wa Munhu yokuya kuli undewa wa heye.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangugaluka kumeho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Malichi 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lukasi 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Logakwete mazuwa sita, Yesu nakawahola Petili na Yakubu na Yohani mng'holoze, nakaluta nawo waliyeka kuchaya kuchidunda chikulu. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Ako, Yesu nakagaluka kumeho hali hewo, kumeho kwa heye nakung'hala kota isanya na nguwo zoyavalile ziwa nzelu kota lumuli. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Musa na Eliya nawawalawila, wali wolongasa na heye. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Aho Petili nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mkulu, inoga kwa hetwe kuwa hano! Hougana ndozenga vibumuli vidatu. Chimwe cha hegwe na chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Loyali yang'hali yolonga ahyo, ng'hungugu nzelu iwagubika, na lizi ihulikwa kulawa kuli ayo ng'hungugu, “Ayu ndo Mwana wa heni ndimganile, ndilingunojezwa na heye. Mhulichizeni.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Walanguswa vyowahuliche ahyo wagwa chifugama, nawadumba ng'hatu. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yesu nakawalutila, kawadoliza, nakalonga, “Mwime mleche kudumba!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Lowalolile kuchanya hawamuwene munhu, ila Yesu nayaliyeka.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Lelo lowali wodulika kulawa kuchidunda, Yesu nakawadeuza, “Mleche kumlonjela munhu mbuli yomuwene mbaka Mwana wa Munhu loyozilipuka kulawa kowabagame.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Hamba walanguswa nawamuuza, “Lekachoni walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa wangulonga igana tandi Eliya yoye?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Mkomya, Eliya kokuya tandi kuwika goya mbuli zeng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Ila ndanguwalonjelani, Eliya mina koya na hewo nahawamzelele, ila nawamditila vila vyowaganile. Hihyo du, Mwana wa Munhu kogazigwa mmoko mwawo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Aho wala walanguswa nawavizela kota yaliyowalonjela mbuli ya Yohani Mbatiza.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola mwana yawele na chijeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Malichi 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Lukasi 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Lowaufichile kahi lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu, munhu yumwe nakamlutila Yesu, kafugama, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>nakalonga, “Mkulu, monele isungu mwana wa heni kwa vila kana chinzilisa, kahi kangugazigwa lukami, mala nyinji heye kagugwa mchiluli na mmazi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Nandimigala kwa walanguswa wa hegwe ila walemwela kumlohola.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesu nakedichila, “Hemwe lulelo lulihela makundo, lwajilile! Ndochikala na hemwe mbaka hanili? Ndowemilila hemwe mbaka hanili? Mmigale hano ayo mwana.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Lelo Yesu nakaching'hanuchila chila chijeni, na heye chimlawa, na yula mwana kawa mkomu mhela wuwo.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Hamba walanguswa nawamlutila Yesu chinyele, nawamuuza, “Lekachoni hetwe tulemwela kulavya chila chijeni?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Kwa vila makundo ga hemwe mado. Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, wone hela muwe na makundo mado kota nyhule ndodo ya haladali, moweza kuchilonjela chidunda achi, ‘Ulawe hano ulute hala,’ Nawo woluta. Kuduhu ne chinhu chilemwelwa kwa hemwe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Vijeni vya nhanzi ino havilavyagwa hihi hela, ila kwa kulanda na kwesela kulya.<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga kahi mbuli ya kubagama na kuzilipuka kwa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Malichi 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Lukasi 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Lowali hamwe ako Galilaya, Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mwana wa Munhu kanguzawichigwa mmoko mwa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>Womkopola, ila zuwa lya kadatu kulawa kubagama, kozilipuligwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Walanguswa nawesinza ng'hatu.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulavya nhambiko kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Lowafichile Kapanaumu wanhu wali wokongoza kodi ya ng'handa ya Nguluwi nawamlutila Petili, wamuuza, “Ndaze, mlangusa wa hemwe kalavyaga kodi ya Ng'handa ya Nguluwi?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Petili nakedichila, “Ena, nakalavyaga.” Lelo Petili loyenjile mgati mwa ng'handa, yang'hali longa luzi, Yesu nakamuuza, “Simoni, hegwe kwangona ndaze? Wandewa wa isi hukongozaga kodi kulawa kwa whaani? Kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi, ama kulawa kwa wajenzi?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Petili nakedichila, “Kulawa kwa wajenzi.” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Hino lelo, hailinguwalapa wanhu wa isi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Ila kwa vila tuleche kuwazudizani, mlute kuli ilamba mkatoze ndoano, ulowe somba ya mwaluko kugwila, ugubule kumlomo, na mgati kozifika sendi za zaka. Uhole ukamhe kwa chiwalo cha heni na ya hegwe.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Yalikohi yawele mng'hangala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Malichi 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lukasi 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Mhela wula walanguswa nawamlutila Yesu, nawamuuza, “Yalikohi yawele mkulu ng'hatu kuli undewa wa kilanga?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesu nakamchema mwana yumwe, kamwimiza hagati hawo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>hamba nakalonga, “Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, wone hamgaluche na kuwa kota wana wadodo, hamkwinjila hebu kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi kilanga.” <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Yoneche yochihanyisa kota mwana ayu, ayo ndo yawele mkulu kuli undewa wa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Yoneche yombochela mwana yumwe kota ayu kwa itagwa lyangu, kangumbochela heni.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chambuzo cha gehile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Malichi 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lukasi 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Yoneche yomwambuza kuwifya yumwe wa awa wana wadodo walingung'hunda, yowa inoga yafunjigwe iganga likulu lya lwala na kukabajizwa kuli lwene lwa bahali.<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone cropped.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">Wanhu weli walingutumiya lwala kubalasa sokolo</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Yochona isi yeng'ha kwa mbuli ya majezo ga kudita gehile. Majezo ago igana galawile, ila kochona yula munhu yula yovyambuza.<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Wone moko ama mgulu wa hegwe ukwambuze kikwang'hwala, udumule na kuutaga kutali na hegwe. Chiba kwa hegwe kwinjila kuli ukomu kuno ulihela moko ama magulu kuwala kutagwa kuli chiluli cha mazuwa gose ne kuduma uwele na moko meli na magulu meli. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Na iziho lyako wone likwambuze kikwang'hwala, wuse na kulitaga kutali na hegwe. Inoga kwa hegwe kwinjila kuli ukomu kuno uwele na iziho limwe, uleka kutajigwa kuli chiluli cha Jehanamu uwele na meho ga hegwe geng'ha meli.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga ing'holo lyajilile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Lukasi 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Milole! Mleche kumbeza yumwe wa wadodo wano. Ndanguwalonjelani, wahilisi wa kilanga wabaho mazuwa gose kumwando ha Mhaza wa heni yawele kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Mina mwana wa munhu nakoya kuwalohola wala wajilile. <verse eid="MAT 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>Mwangona ndaze? Munhu nayali na ming'holo miya, wone yajilize limwe, kodita ndaze? Kowaleka wala makumi tisa na tisa kuchidunda, nakuluta kumpala yula yajilile. <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Hoyompata, ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, kosangalala kwa chiwalo cha ayo kusinda vyoyosangalala kwa chiwalo cha wala makumi tisa na tisa hawajilile. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Hihyo du, Mhaza wa hemwe wa kilanga halingugana ne yumwe wa awa wadodo yajilile.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumkanya lumbu ama kalumbu yalingudita gehile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Mng'holozo wone yakuditile vibi, ulute ukamlonjele muwele hemwe mliyeka. Wone yakuhuliche kowa umpatile mng'holozo. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Wone halingukuhulika, mhole munhu yumwe ama weli hamwe na hegwe, leka kwa udedezi wa walolezi weli ama wadatu, chila nongwa yoditikwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Wone hambe yawahuliche awo, chilonjele chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu. Na wone hambe yahuliche chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, na yawe kwa hegwe kota wanhu wohawamzelele Nguluwi na wakongoza sendi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulemeza na kukundiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, chila chomuhinda muisi chohindigwa kilanga, na chila chomchumula muisi chochumuligwa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>Kahi ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, weli wa hemwe wakundile kuwa hamwe hano muisi kwa mbuli yoneche ya kulanda, Mhaza wa heni wa kilanga kowaditila mbuli yiyo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Kwa vila heng'ha hala walingiting'hana weli ama wadatu kwa itagwa lya heni, heni ndabaho hali hewo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga chitumagwa yalemwelile kumlechela miyage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Hamba Petili kamlutila Yesu, kamuuza, “Mkulu, ndaze, mng'holozangu wone yanditile vibi, ndimleche lwa kalinga? Mala saba?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu nakamwidichila, “Silingulonga mala saba hela,” Ila makumi saba mala saba. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Ndo mina undewa wa kilanga ufanda kota mndewa yumwe yaganile kukagula uwazo wa vitumagwa wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Kukagula lokwaluche, kegalilwa munhu yumwe yawele daigwa sendi elufu kumi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Munhu ayo yalihela chinhu cha kuhilusa, ahyo mkulu wa heye nakagana yaguzigwe heye na mchewake na wanage na vinhu vyeng'ha vyoyalinavyo, kulipila lila deni. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Lelo ayo chitumagwa kafugama kumwando ha heye, nakalonga, “Umbeteze na heni ndolipa deni lyeng'ha.” <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Yula mkulu na kamonela isungu, kamlechela lila deni, kamlechela yalute.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Ila ayo chitumagwa nakoka, kamfika yumwe wa vitumagwa wayage yawele na deni lya heye sendi denali miya imwe. Kamibata, kamdinga lumelo yolonga, ‘Ulipe deni lyako!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Ayo chitumagwa miyage kamfugamila, kamlanda, ‘Umbeteze nani ndokulipa!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Ila heye haviganile, leka kamuwika mchinweng'ho mbaka hoyolipa deni.<verse eid="MAT 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>“Lelo vitumagwa wayage vyowawene mbuli ayo wawa na masinzo ng'hatu, nawaluta kumlonjela mkulu wa hewo mbuli ilawile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Aho yula mkulu kamchema ayo chitumagwa, nakumlonjela, ‘Hegwe kwa chitumagwa wihile ng'hatu! Nakundanda nani ndikulechela ideni lya hegwe lyeng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Ndaze, haikuganile nagwe kumonela isungu chitumagwa muyago kota heni vyondikonele isungu?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Lelo ayo mkulu nakazudila lukami, nakamlavya ayo chitumagwa yagazigwe mbaka baho hoyolipa deni lyeng'ha.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>Yesu nakasindila kwa kulonga, “Na Mhaza wa heni yawele kilanga kowaditilani hihyo wone chila yumwe wa hemwe yolema kumlechela mng'holoze kwa nhumbula ya heye yeng'ha.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Malichi 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesu loyasindile kulonga mbuli azo, nakalawa Galilaya, kaluta Yudeya, kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Wanhu wenji na wamuwinza ako, na wawele watamwa nakawosela matamwa gawo.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Mafalisayo wamwenga nawamuyila, wamuuza wojeza kumgwiliza, “Ndaze, yowa goya mlume kumha luleko mchewake kwa mbuli yoneche yeng'ha ila?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndaze, hamsomile kuli Maandiko Matakatifu kota Nguluwi yamlumbile munhu kulawila mwaluko nakalumba mlume na mdala? <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Baho nakalonga, ‘Ndo mina mlume kangumlekaga mhaza na mayake, na kilumba hamwe na mdala wa heye, nawo weli wowa lukuli lumwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Leka ahyo, hewo hawele weli kahi ila yumwe. Lelo choyalumbanize Nguluwi, munhu yaleche kulekaniza.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Ila Mafalisayo nawamuuza, “Lekachoni lelo Musa nakatulajiza mdala yapegwe kalatasi ya luleko na kulechigwa?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Musa nakawakundila kuwaleka wadala wa hemwe kwa vila mwali na nhumbula zigagadale. Ila haiwele hino kulawa mhela Nguluwi loyalumbile. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Lelo ndanguwalonjelani, yoneche yomleka mchewake ila kwa mbuli ya ung'hondwa, nakuhola mdala yunji, kangudita ung'hondwa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Walanguswa wa heye nawamlonjela, “Wone mbuli za mlume na mdala ndo azo, inoga tuleche ng'hatu kuhola.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Haiwele weng'ha walinguweza kuibochela mbuli ayi, ila wala hela wowatambichizwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Mina hana mbuli zinji za kuleka kuhola, wanji kwa vila waleleka hiho, wanji kwa vila waditigwa hino na wanhu, na wanji nawagana waleche kuhola kwa mbuli ya undewa wa kilanga. Yoneche yoweza kubochela ilanguso ali nayabochele.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwatambichiza wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Malichi 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lukasi 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Hamba wanhu nawamigalila Yesu wana wadodo leka yawawichile moko na kuwalandila na kuwakumbatiza, ila walanguswa nawawang'hanuchila. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Yesu nakalonga, “Muwaleche awo wana wadodo woye kwa heni, mleche kuwalemeza, mina undewa wa kilanga ndo wa wanhu wafandile kota wana awa.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Lelo kawawichila moko na kuwakumbatiza, hamba koka honhu aho.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Msongolo yawele na lufufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Malichi 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lukasi 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Munhu yumwe nakamuyila Yesu, nakumuuza, “Mlangusa, ndite choni chinojile leka ndiuhalile ukomu wa mazuwa gose ne kuduma?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Lekachoni kwangumbuza kuli Mbuli Inojile? Kabaho yumwe hela yanojile. Wone ugana kwinjila kuli ukomu wa mazuwa gose, ibate malajizo ga Nguluwi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Yula munhu nakamuuza, “Malajizo galikohi?” Yesu nakalonga, “Uleche kukopola, uleche kudita ung'hondwa, uleche kuhiza, na uleche kulavya ulolezi wa udesi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>Wahulichize mhaza na mayako, na migane na mlingikalasa halibehi kota vyoulingigana gwegwe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ayo msongolo nakamlonjela, “Ago geng'ha ndagudita, ndite choni kahi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Wone ulingugana ukangaliche, ulute ukaguze vinhu vya hegwe, uwape wazunwa sendi azo, na hegwe kowa na ng'hano kilanga, hamba uye umbinze.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Ayo msongolo loyahuliche ago, nakaluta yawele na masinzo, mina nayali na lufufu lwinji.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Aho Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya haiwa ubewe kwa yawele na lufufu kwinjila kuli undewa wa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Kahi ndanguwalonjelani, yowa ubewe kwa ngamiya kukola kuli itubuli lya chihomo, kuleka kwa yawele na lufufu kwinjila kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Wala walanguswa lowahuliche ahyo wabubuwala ng'hatu, nawamuuza, “Lelo yalikohi yoloholigwa?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesu kawalola, kalonga, “Kwa munhu mbuli ayi haiditikwa ne hado, ila kwa Nguluwi mbuli zeng'ha zoditikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Hamba Petili nakalonga, “Na hetwe ndaze? Tuleka geng'ha natukuwinza hegwe, lelo tokwambulila choni?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, Mwana wa Munhu lohochikala hali chigoda cha undewa cha ukulu wa heye kuli isi inyale, hemwe mumuwinzile mochikala hali vigoda vya undewa muwatagusa nhanzi kumi na mbili za Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Na chila munhu yalechile ng'handa ama wang'holoze ama lumbu ama mhaza ama mayake ama wana ama migunda, kwa mbuli ya heni, kobochela mala miya mzidi, na wowa na ukomu wa mazuwa gose ne kuduma. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Ila wawele wa mwaluko wowa wa mwiso, na wawele wa mwiso wowa wa mwaluko.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Wakola mijito kuli mgunda wa zabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Undewa wa kilanga ufanda kota ahi. Munhu yawele na mgunda wa zabibu, yedawile kuza pala wanhu wa kukola mijito kuli mgunda wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Kalongasa na hewo kowapa sendi denali imwe ya mijito ya zuwa imwe, hamba kawahilika kuli mgunda wa heye wa mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Nakalawa kuli saa zidatu mitondo, kawona wanhu wanji wemile hali soko, walihela mijito ya kukola. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>Kawalonjela, ‘Mlute na hemwe mkakole mijito kuli mgunda wa zabibu, nani ndowapa sendi ya mijito ya zuwa imwe kota wayenu.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Baho waluta. Ayo yawele na mgunda kalawa kahi kuli saa sita na saa tisa, kadita hihyo. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Naloifichile kuli saa kumi na imwe matinazo, kalawa kahi, kawafika wanji wemile hahala hali soko. Baho, kawauza, ‘Ndaze mwimile hano nemisi yeng'ha mlihela mijito?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Wamwidichila, ‘Kwa vila kuduhu munhu yatupele mijito.’ Na heye nakawalonjela, ‘Mlute namwe mkakole mijito kuli mgunda wa heni wa mizabibu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Lokutitile, ayo yawele na mgunda wa zabibu nakamlonjela mlolela ng'hano wa heye, ‘Wacheme wakola mijito uwape sendi zawo, ukwaluchila wala woyile wa mwiso, na kusindila kwa wala watomile kuya.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Lelo nawoya wala waluche mijito saa kumi na imwe, wabochela chila yumwe sendi denali imwe ya mijito ya zuwa imwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Wala waluche lowoyile, wali wochijesa wopegwa nyinji ng'hatu, ila na hewo wapegwa chila yumwe sendi denali imwe ya mijito ya zuwa imwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Wabochela sendi zawo, nakwaluka kumng'ung'utila yula mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>Walonga, ‘Wanhu awa woya mwiso wakola mijito kwa saa imwe hela, ndaze kuwaditila twiwhana na hewo hanga hetwe twimilila mijito ng'hangala zuwa yeng'ha na isanya ling'ang'ale?’<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>“Aho yula mkulu kamwidichila yumwe wa hewo, ‘Wang'holozangu siwabunzile chinhu! Ndaze, hatulongane ndokupani sendi denali imwe ya mijito ya zuwa imwe? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Uhole chotulongane ulute. Ndangugana ndimpe na ayu wa mwiso iwhanile na hegwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Ndaze, haiwa goya heni kudita ndiviganile na sendi za heni? Ndaze, kwangona maya kwa vila vyondili na nhumbula inojile?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Yesu nakasinda kwa kulonga, “Ahyo, wawele wa mwiso wowa wa mwaluko na wa mwaluko sambi wowa wa mwiso.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga lwa kadatu kubagama na kuzilipuka kwa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Malichi 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lukasi 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesu loyali yoluta Yelusalemu, nakawahola wala walanguswa kumi na weli honhu ha uyeka, na mnzila kawalonjela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Mhulichize!” “Twanguluta Yelusalemu, na ako Mwana wa Munhu kowichigwa mmoko mwa watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa, na hewo womtagusa kwa wihe yabagame. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Womuwika kwa wanhu hawawele Wayahudi leka wambeze, yasubuligwe ng'hobwa na kugazigwa na kumkopola kwa kumuwamba mumsalaba, ila zuwa lya kadatu kulawa yabagame kozilipuligwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa mayao Yakubu na Yohani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Malichi 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Aho mayawo wana wa Sebedayo nakamuyila Yesu hamwe na wanage, kafugama kumwando koyali na kumlanda chinhu. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Kwangugana choni?” Ayo mamo nakamlonjela, “Ulonje kota kuli undewa wa hegwe, awa wana wa heni weli wochikala yumwe kudilo kwa hegwe na yumwe kumoso.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Hamvizelele mwangulanda choni! Ndaze, moweza kunwela chizombe cha kugazigwa chondinwela heni?” Wamwidichila, “Toweza.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu kawalonjela, “Mwangukomya monwela chizombe cha kugazigwa chondinwela heni, ila kikala kudilo ama kumoso kwa heni haiwele mbuli ya heni kudita, mbuli ayo Mhaza wa heni nakawahagula walinguganigwa kikala honhu hala na kahi nakawagongomanyila honhu kwa chiwalo cha hewo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Wala walanguswa wanji kumi lowahuliche ago, wawazudila awo wang'holozawo weli. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Ahyo Yesu nakawachema, kawalonjela, “Mvizela vilongozi wa isi zinji walongozaga wanhu wawo kwa lupichi, na wakulu awo wawemililaga wanhu wawo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Ila kwa hemwe ileche kuwa ahyo, leka yalingugana yawe mkulu hali hemwe, yawe chitumagwa wa weng'ha, <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>na yalingugana yawe wa mwaluko hali hemwe, igana yawe chitumagwa wa hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Hihyo vyoiwele, Mwana wa Munhu hoyile kukolelwa mijito, ila kuwakolela mijito na kuulavya ukomu wa heni kwa ulohozi wa wanhu wenji.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalohola hambe walole weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Malichi 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lukasi 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yesu loyali yokuka kuli muji wa Yeliko, lung'hongola lwa wanhu nalumuwinza. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Lelo kwali na wohambe walole weli wekale hafungo mwa nzila, na lowahuliche kota Yesu yaliyokola aho, nawachemeleza, “Mkulu, Mwana wa Daudi, utonele isungu!” <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu luwang'anuchila na kuwalonjela wanyamalile. Ila hewo walutilila kuchemelela, “Mkulu, Mwana wa Daudi, utonele isungu!” <verse eid="MAT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesu nakema, kawachema na kuwauza, “Mwangugana ndiwaditile choni?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Nawamwidichila, “Mkulu, twangulanda meho ga hetwe gagubuligwe.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Lelo Yesu kawonela isungu, kawadoliza meho gawo, na bahala waluka kulola goya, wamuwinza.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangwinjila Yelusalemu kwa luchenze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malichi 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lukasi 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yesu na walanguswa wa heye lowafichile behi na Yelusalemu wafichile Betifage kuli chidunda cha Mizeituni, nakawalajiza walanguswa wa heye weli, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>nakawalonjela, “Mlute mbaka hali chijiji chiwele kumwando kwa hemwe molifika idogowi na mwana idogowi liwohigwe. Jichumuleni mujigale kwa heni. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Wone munhu yawauze chiwalo, mumlonjele ‘Mkulu kangujigana,’ Na heye kowalechelani baho.” <verse eid="MAT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Mbuli ino na ikoleka leka gala galonjigwe na mloli wa Nguluwi genele,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Muulonjele muji wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">ulole, Mndewa wa hegwe kanguya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Kaliholile na kakwina idogowi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">mwana wa idogowi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Ahyo, wala walanguswa nawadita kota Yesu vyoyawalajize. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Waligala lila idogowi na mwanage, watambalika nguwo za hewo mchanya hao na Yesu kekalisa mchanya mwake. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Lung'hongola lwa wanhu nawazanza nguwo zawo mbalabala, na wanji watema miputi ja migodi wanzanza mbalabala. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Lung'hongola lwa wanhu walongole na wala walingumuwinza wakwiniza lizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">“Lutogo kwa Mwana wa Daudi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Nguluwi yamtogole heye yalinguya kwa itagwa lya Mkulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Lutogo kwa Nguluwi kuchanya!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Yesu loyaliyokwinjila Yelusalemu, muji weng'ha naumema luchenze. Wanhu wali wouza, “Ayu ka whaani?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Wanhu kuli lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu walonga, “Ayu ndo Yesu mloli wa Nguluwi, kangulawa Nasaleti isi ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangwinjila kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Malichi 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lukasi 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Lelo Yesu nakenjila mli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, kawawinga wanhu kunze wali woguza na kugula vinhu mgati mwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Kagudula visaga vya wala wali wovunza sendi, kagudula vigoda vya wala wali woguza ng'hunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Kawalonjela, “Yandichigwa kuli Maandiko Matakatifu, ‘Ng'handa ya heni yochemigwa ng'handa ya kulandila.’ Ila hemwe muigalula iwa mhalika ya wabokaji!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Wawele hambe walole na waziliche ng'huli nawamlutila kuko kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, na heye kawalohola. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Lelo watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa nawazudila lowawene vinduzanduza vyoyaditile Yesu, na kahi wana lowali wochemelela kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi wolonga, “Lutogo kwa Mwana wa Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Ahyo wamlonjela, “Ndaze, hulinguhulika chowolonga?” Yesu nakawedichile, “Ena, ndanguhulika! Ndaze, hamnasoma Maandiko aga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">“ ‘Kuwalangusa wana wadodo na wali chali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">wanguwa na lutogo ng'hatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Leka, kawaleka, kalawa kunze ya muji wa Betaniya, nakuwasa kuko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguupanjila msada wohambe ulele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Malichi 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Yesu loyali yohiluka kuli muji lokuwele kung'hali lufuku, nakona nzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Nakalyona igodi limwe lya misada hafungo mwa nzila, kalilutila, ila kalifika lilihela mafuza goneche leka mahamba yeka. Lelo kalilonjela, “Uleche kulela kahi mafuza mazuwa gose!” Baho alyo igodi lya misada naliswina. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Walanguswa lowawene wabubuwala wolonga, “Lekachoni igodi ali lya misada liswina baho du?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, wone muwe na makundo ne kuwa na majesa, moweza kudita vyonditile kuli lila igodi lya misada, leka nawone mchilonjele chidunda chino, ‘Ung'humbuche ukagwe kuli bahali,’ Yokoleka hihyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Na muwe na makundo, choneche chomumlanda Nguluwi mopegwa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ludali lwa Yesu lwanguuzigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Malichi 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lukasi 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesu nakenjila mli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, kawa yolangusa. Loyali yolangusa, watambika wakulu na wasekelu wa wanhu wamuuza, “Kwangudita mbuli zino kwa ludali lwachi? Yalikohi yakupele ludali luno?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesu kawedichila, “Na heni ndowauzani chinhu chimwe, lomkwidichila, leka nani ndowalonjelani ndangudita mbuli azi kwa ludali lwachi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Ndanguwauza mndonjele, ndaze, ludali lwa Yohani lwa kubatiza nalulawa kwa whaani? Ndaze, nalulawa kwa Nguluwi ama kwa wanhu?” Ila naweuza hewo kwa hewo hino, “Hotulonga, ‘Naulawa kilanga, kotuuza, Lelo lekachoni hamumkundile?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Ila hotulonga, ‘Nalulawa kwa wanhu,’ Twangudumba wanhu wamemile mina hewo weng'ha wangukunda kota Yohani ndo mloli wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Lelo nawamwidichila, “Hatuvizelele!” Na heye Yesu nakawalonjela, “Na heni kahi siwalonjela ndangudita mbuli zino kwa ludali lwachi.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga wana weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Hemwe mwangijesa ndaze kwa mbuli ayi, kwali na munhu yumwe nayali na wana weli. Nakamlonjela yula wa mwaluko, ‘Mwanangu, lehano ulute ukadite mijito kuli mgunda wa zabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Yula msongolo nakamlonjela, ‘Ndema!’ Hamba kagalusa kaluta kumgunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Yula mhaza nakamlonjela mwana wa keli hiho, na heye kedichila, ‘Ena mhaza ndoluta!’ Ila halutile kukola mijito. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Ndaze, yalikohi kuli awa weli yaditile kota vyoyaganile mhaza wa heye?” Wamwidichila, “Ayula wa mwaluko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Lelo Yesu kawalonjela, “Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, wakongoza sendi na wahonzolomo wokwinjila kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi kusinda hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Yohani na koya kwa hemwe kawalajila nzila inojile ya ukomu, na hemwe hamumkundile, ila wakongoza sendi na wahonzolomo nawamkunda. Nahomuwene ago geng'ha hemwe mlema ne kumfugamila na kumkunda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwalo cha walimi na mgunda wa zabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Malichi 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lukasi 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Yesu kalonga, “Hulichizeni nhelo yinji. Munhu yumwe yawele na ng'handa nakalima mgunda wa zabibu, nakazungulusila lugagala, kabawa ideho lya kukamila divai, kazenga mumo mnala kahi. Hamba nakawabasila walimi, heye koka nakaheluka isi ya kutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Mhela wa kubeta loufichile, nakawalajiza vitumagwa kwa wala wanhu wakahole chasi cha mbena ya heye. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Wala wanhu wawebata awo vitumagwa, yumwe wamsubula, yunji wamkopola na yunji wamtowa na maganga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Ayo munhu nakawalajiza vitumagwa wanji, wenji kupuluta wala wa mwaluko. Wala wanhu wawaditila hihila. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Vyokudumile kamlajiza mwanagme aku yochijesa, ‘Womhulichiza mwana wa heni.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Ila wala wanhu lowamuwene mwanage walonga hewo kwa hewo, ‘Ayu ndo yohalila, tumkopole leka tuhole uhalizi wa heye!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Leka, wamibata, wamlavya kunze ya ula mgunda wa zabibu, wamkopola.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>“Yesu nakawauza lelo, ayo yawele na mgunda wa zabibu loyokuya, kowadita ndaze awo wanhu?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Hewo wamwidichila, “Kowabagamiza vibi awo wehile,” “Na ula mgunda wa zabibu kowapa walimi wanji wowa wompa chasi cha mbena mhela wake.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Aho Yesu kawalonjela, “Ndaze, hamsomile mbuli ino kuli Maandiko Matakatifu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">“ ‘Iganga lya kuzenjela walilemile walinguzenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">sambi liwa iganga likulu lya msisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Mkulu ndo yaditile mbuli ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nayo ndo ya kububuwaza ng'hatu kwa hetwe!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>“Yesu nakonjezela kulonga,” Ahyo ndanguwalonjelani, “Undewa wa Nguluwi wokusigwa kwa hemwe na kupegwa wanhu hawawele Wayahudi walingulavya mafuza ganojile. <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Yoneche yogwa mchanya mwa iganga alyo kobeneka pasapasa, na wone iganga limgwile munhu yoneche, lyomhondanga.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo lowahuliche azo nhelo za heye kanguwalonga hewo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Lelo wali wopala chinhu cha kumibata, ila nawaliwodumba wanhu kwa vila hewo nawavizela heye Yesu nayali mloli wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Malanguso ga mnvina ya kuhesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Lukasi 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu nakalonga nawo kahi kwa nhelo, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Undewa wa kilanga wiwhana kota hino, kwali na mndewa yamditichile mwanage mnvina ya kuhesa. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Lelo kawalajiza vitumagwa wawacheme walalikwe woye kuli mnvina, ila wala walalikwe walema kuya. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Kawalajiza kahi vitumagwa wanji, yolonga, ‘Muwalonjele wala walalikwe, ndiya ya heni ya goya sambi, isenga lya heni na ilogota lihatile wachinjigwa, chila chinhu cha goya, muye kuli izenjele.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Ila hewo hawang'ulile, waluta, yumwe kumgunda kwa heye, yunji kuli mbuli za heye, <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>na wanji wawebata awala vitumagwa wawaliga na kuwakopola. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Yula mndewa nakazudila, kawalajiza wamizi wa heye wakawabagamize awo wakopolaji na kuwasomela luga lwao. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Hamba kawalonjela vitumagwa wa heye, ‘Ndiya ya izenjele ya goya ng'hatu, ila walalikwe wachakachaka. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Lelo mlute kuli nzila mhanda na woneche wala womuwafika wachemeni woye kuli izenjele.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Wala vitumagwa walawa, waluta kunzila wawegala wanhu weng'ha, wehile na wanojile. Ng'handa ya izenjele na imema wajenzi.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Mndewa loyenjile kawona wajenzi, kamona munhu yumwe yawele havalile nguo za mnvina. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Mndewa kamuuza, ‘Mng'holozangu, kwinjila ndaze hano houvalile ivalo lya mnvina?’ Ila heye nakanyamalila tulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Aho mndewa kawalonjela vitumagwa, ‘Muwopeni magulu na moko mkamtaje kunze kuli kutitu, ako kolila na kujejeda mizino.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Yesu nakasinda kwa kulonga, “Walalikwa wenji, ila wahaguligwe wachefu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulavya kodi kwa Kaizali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Malichi 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lukasi 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Hamba, Mafalisayo waluta, welonjelela nzila ya kumgwiliza Yesu kwa ulonzi wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Lelo wawalajiza vitumagwa wa hewo hamwe na walanguswa wa chilundo cha Helodi. Nawamuuza, “Mlangusa, tuvizela kota hegwe kwa munhu wakitumbila, na kota kwa kulangusa nzila ya Nguluwi kwa kukomya ng'hatu, hulingumdumba munhu yoneche, mina ukulu wa munhu hauwele chinhu kwa hegwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Lelo tulonjele majesa ga hegwe. Ndaze, iwa goya ama hebu kulavya kodi kwa mndewa wa Loma?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Ila Yesu nakavizela wihe wa hewo wowalingijesa nakuwalonjela, “Hemwe wahadi lekachoni mwangunjeza? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Mndajile sendi yomlingulavila kodi.” Na hewo wamlavila igwala lya sendi. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Lelo Yesu nakawauza, “Mutwi na itagwa ali ndo lya whaani?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Nawamwidichila, “Ndo cha mndewa wa Loma.” Aho Yesu kawalonjela, “Lelo ga mndewa wa Loma mmigalile mndewa wa Loma na ga Nguluwi mmigalile Nguluwi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Lowahuliche ahyo nawabubuwala wamleka, woka.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulanguso wa mbuli ya kuzilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Malichi 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lukasi 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Zuwa alyo, wamwe wa Masadukayo nawawele wolonga wabagame hawozilipuka nawamlutila Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Lelo nawamlonjela, “Mlangusa, Musa nakalonga munhu yaholile mdala wone yabagame ne kulela mwana, imgana mng'holoze, yamhole yula mdala mlekwa, leka yamlelele wana mng'holoze. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Lelo aha hetu kwali na wanhu saba wa lulelo lumwe. Wa mwaluko nakabagama ne kulela mwana, ayula mdala mlekwa nakaholeka kahi na mng'holoze. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Iwa hihyo kwa wakeli na wakadatu, mbaka weng'ha saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Awo weng'ha lowabagame, na yula mdala nakabagama. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Lelo zuwa lya wabagame kuzilipuka mdala ayo kowa mdala wa yalikohi kwa wala walume saba? Mina weng'ha saba namhola yuye.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesu nakawedichila, “Hemwe muwifya kwa vila hamgazelele Maandiko Matakatifu ne mong'ho wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Mina wabagame howozilipuka hawohesa ne kuhesigwa hebu, wowa kota wahilisi wa kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Ila kwa mbuli ya kuzilipuka kwa wabagame, ndaze, hamsomile gala goyawalonjele Nguluwi? Nakawalonjela, <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Heni nda Nguluwi wa Abulahamu na wa Isaka na wa Yakubu!’ Lelo heye hawele Nguluwi wa wabagame ila ndo Nguluwi wa wawele wakomu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu loluhuliche ahyo, lububuwala kwa ulanguso wa heye.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mzilo ukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Malichi 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lukasi 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Masadukayo lowahuliche kota Mafalisayo wahela chinhu chinji cha kumuuza kahi Yesu, nawating'hana hamwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Yumwe wa hewo, mtagusa, nakamuuza Yesu kwa kumjeza, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Mlangusa, malajizo galikohi ndo gawele makulu kuli utaguso?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesu nakamwidichila, “ ‘Umgane Mkulu Nguluwi wa hegwe kwa nhumbula ya hegwe yeng'ha na kwa muhe wa hegwe weng'ha na kwa luhala lwa hegwe lweng'ha.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Ali ndo ilajizo liwele likulu na lya mwaluko. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Lya keli iwhana na lilyo, ‘Umgane youlingikalasa habehi kota vyoulingigana gwegwe baho.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Malajizo ga Musa gandichigwe na waloli wa Nguluwi gangitumbila mizilo aji mili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya mlohozi yalingubetezwa kuya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Malichi 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lukasi 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Mafalisayo lowating'hane hamwe, Yesu nakawauza, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Hemwe mwangona ndaze mbuli ya Kilistu Mlohozi? Ka mwana wa whaani?” Wamwidichila, “Mwana Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesu kawalojela, “Lelo iwa ndaze,” “Kota kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile Daudi kangumchema heye ‘Mkulu’? Mina nakalonga,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>“ ‘Mkulu nakamlonjela Mkulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">wikale nzingo ya kudilo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mbaka ndiwawiche wang'honyo wa hegwe hasi ha magulu ga hegwe.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Lelo wone Daudi kangumchema Kilistu ‘Mkulu,’ iwa ndaze yawe mwana wa heye?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Kuduhu munhu yoneche yajezile kumwidichila chinhu. Na kulawa zuwa lila kuduhu ne munhu kahi yajezile kumuuza chinhu.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalonga Walangusa wa Malajizo na Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Malichi 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Lukasi 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Hamba Yesu kawalonjela wanhu wamemile hamwe na walanguswa wa heye, Nakalonga. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>Nakawalonjela, Walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wana ludali lwa kutang'hula malajizo. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Lelo mibatilile na kudita choneche chowowalonjelani. Ila mleche kuwinza chowodita, mina hawalingudita gala gowalingudamla kwa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Wawohaga mifulusi na kuwapapiza wayawo mmayega, ila hewo wawo wangulema kugolola ne chidole wapape. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Hewo huditaga madito gawo leka wanhu wawone. Mlole ukulu wa vibende vilingulajila Malajizo mchihanga na mmoko na mlole kugonzoka kwa lupembo lwa utabuli wa mikoti jawo. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Huganaga kikala honhu hatanganiche kuli mnvina na vigoda vitanganiche kuli ng'handa za kusalila. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Waganaga kulamsigwa kwa kutogoligwa kuli masoko na wogana kuchemigwa na wanhu, “Mlangusa.” <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Ila hemwe mleche chemigwa ng'oo “Mlangusa,” mina mlangusa wa hemwe ndo yumwe hela, hemwe mweng'ha mwa lukolo lumwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Namleche kumchema munhu yoneche “Mhaza,” Hano hali isi, mina Mhaza wa hemwe ndo yumwe hela, yawele kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Namleche kuchemigwa, “Vilongozi,” Mina mlongozi wa hemwe ndo yumwe hela, yuye Kilistu Mlohozi. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Yawele mng'hangala hali hemwe yawe chitumagwa wa hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Yochikwiniza koduliswa, na yoneche yawele liholile kokwinizwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga mbuli ya udesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Malichi 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Lukasi 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Mochona mwemwe walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mwawahadi! Mwanguhinda lwizi lwa undewa wa kilanga hali meho ga wanhu. Hemwe mwemwe hamlingwinjila mng'handa, na mwanguwalemeza wanji walingugana kwinjila wenjile. <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Mochona mwemwe walangusa wa malajizo na Mafalisayo, mwawahadi! Mwanguwabunza na kwa usugu mwanguwasukula walekwa ng'handa za hewo na kisinjizila kota mwa wanhu wanojile kwa kulanda kwa kulutilila. Lelo kwa mbuli ahyo mogazigwa lukami.<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>“Mochona mwemwe walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mwawahadi! Mwanguheluka kuli bahali na isi zinji leka muwe munhu yumwe yawinze dini ya hemwe. Homuwa na heye, mwangumdita yalute kuli chiluli cha Jehanamu kusinda hila vyoyawele.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>“Mochona mwemwe vilongozi hambe mlole! Hemwe mwangulangusa, ‘Wone munhu yochilaha kwa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, kilaha ako hakuwele chinhu, ila one yelahe kwa zahabu ya Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, kilaha ako kwangumibata.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Hemwe hambe mlole wapoka! Chakohi chitanganiche ng'hatu? Dhahabu ama Ng'handa ya Nguluwi lilinguidita ayo dhahabu iwe yelile? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Kahi mwangulonga kuta one munhu yelahe kwa honhu ha kulavila nhambiko haiwele chinhu, ila one yelahe kuli nhambiko iwichigwe hachanya ha alitale, kilaha ako humbataga. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Hemwe mohambe mlole! Chakohi chiwele chitanganiche ng'hatu, aila nhambiko, ama hala hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ndo halinguidita ayo nhambiko iwe yelile? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Munhu yalingilaha kwa hala honhu helile kelaha kwa hala kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, na choneche chiwichigwe hachanya hake. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Na yalingilaha kwa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi kelaha kwa ayo Ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kahi kwa yula Nguluwi yekale mgati. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Na yalingilaha kwa kilanga kelaha kwa chigoda cha undewa cha Nguluwi, na kwa heye Nguluwi yalingikala mchigoda acho. <verse eid="MAT 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>Mochona mwemwe walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, wahadi! Mwangulavya kwa Nguluwi chinhu chimwe kulawa kuli vinhu kumi na tangawizi kota vila mahamba galingununyilila, binzali na jila na aku mleka vinhu vitanganiche kuli Malajizo ga Musa kota vila mbuli zilingutagusa goya na isungu na makundo. Ahi ndo vyomlinguganigwa kudita ne kusemwa zila zinji. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Vilongozi wohambe mlole! Mwangusa chinhu chidodo kota ng'honzi kuli vyakunwa, ila mwangumela chinhu chikulu kota isenga.<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Mochona mwemwe walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, wahadi! Mwanguhovuga chizombe na chisaye kwa kunze, ila mgati mwanguleka chimemile ubuhu vinhu vihile vya ubochelezi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Mfalisayo yohambe ulole! Uhovuje chizombe mgati tandi na kunze kowa kuzelu hihyo.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Mochona mwemwe walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, wahadi! Mfanda kota vilaga. Mwangubakaliza lung'halilo luzelu kwa kunze gangoneka gangung'ala, ila kwa mgati gamemile mizeje ja wabagame na chila chinhu chihile. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Vivila kahi na hemwe mwangoneka na wanhu kwa kunze kota mtanganika, ila kwa mgati mmemile uhadi na wihe.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulagula kugazigwa kwa hewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Lukasi 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Mochona mwemwe walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, wahadi! Mwanguzenga vilaga vya waloli na kung'haliza vilaga vya wanhu watanganiche. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Mwangulonga, ‘Kota hetwe natwalingikala mhela wa wasekulu wa hetwe twangihanza na hewo kuli mbuli ya kuwakopola waloli.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Hambi mwangulavya ulolezi mwemwe baho kota hemwe mwa wana wa wanhu wawakopole waloli. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Ena, mgongomanye jila mijito jowaluche wasekulu wa hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Hemwe lulelo lwa mizoka jiwele na dunga! Mouhusa ndaze utaguso wa chiluli cha Jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Ndo mina heni ndanguwahilichila hemwe waloli, wanhu wawele na luhala na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa, mowakopola na kuwagaza wamwe wa hewo, na wanji mowasubula ng'hobwa kuli ng'handa za kusalila na kuwapala kuli chila honhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Hino nongwa yeng'ha yokuyilani kwa mbuli ya danda yeng'ha ya wanhu watanganiche iboholigwe mchanya mwa isi. Ena, kulawa kukopoligwa kwa Abeli nayali hela nongwa mbaka kukopoligwa kwa Sakaliya, mwana wa Balakia, yula mumkopole kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi hala honhu helile na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, lulelo alu logazigwa kwa mbuli ino ya kukopola.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vyoyawaganile wanhu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Lukasi 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Yelusalemu! Gwa Yelusalemu! Kwanguwakopola waloli na kuwatowa kwa maganga wala watumigwe kwa hegwe. Lwa kalinga njeza kuwakungajiza wana wa hegwe kwa heni kota vila ng'huku vyoilingukungajiza vinziya vya heye hasi hali mbawa za heye, ila hegwe nahuviganile! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Hambi lelo, ng'handa ya hegwe yolekwa chihame. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Ndanguwalonjelani, humbona kahi mbaka mhela houlonga, ‘Yatambichizwe ayo yalinguya kwa itagwa lya Mkulu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga kubomoligwa kwa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Malichi 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lukasi 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu nakalawa kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, naloyali yoluta, walanguswa wa heye nawamlutila, wamlajila vyoizenjigwe goya Ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Yesu kawalonjela, “Ena, moweza kugalola aga geng'ha! Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, kuduhu ne iganga limwe lipona aho mchanya mwa liyage, chila chinhu chowifigwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kugazika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Malichi 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lukasi 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesu loyali yekale mchanya mwa chidunda cha Mzeituni, walanguswa nawamlutila chinyele hafungo, nawamuuza, “Utulonjele mbuli azi zolawila hanili? Chilajilo chachi chitulajila kuya kwa hegwe na kuduma kwa mhela?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesu kawedichila, “Milolele mleche kuhadigwa na munhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Mina wenji wolawila wolonga chila yumwe kota, ‘Heni ndo Kilistu Mlohozi’ Na hewo wowajiliza wanhu wenji. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Mohulika mbuli ya ngondo na uhesi wa ngondo, ila mleche kisinza, mina ago gokuya kulawila, ila kuduma kung'hali. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Isi imwe yochitowa na isi iyage, undewa umwe wochitowa na undewa uyage. Ahano na ahala howa na nzala na jimachinyina. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Geng'ha ago ndo kota mwaluko wa usungu wa kulela mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Hamba wowalavya leka mgazigwe na kukopoligwa. Isi zeng'ha zowazudilani kwa mbuli ya itagwa lya heni. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Kahi, wenji woleka makundo ga hewo, wochibagula na kizudila. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Wolawila waloli wenji wa udesi wowajiliza wanhu wenji. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Kwa mbuli ya konjezeka kwa wehile, igano lya munhu lyotita. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Ila munhu yula yokwimilila mbaka kuduma ndo heye yoloholigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Leka, kuduma hakunafika, Mbuli Inojile ya Undewa wa Nguluwi yodamligwa kota ulolezi kwa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya ng'hatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Malichi 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lukasi 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>“Lelo lomkona ‘Izudizo lilinguwifya Ng'handa ya Nguluwi,’ Lilonjigwe na mloli wa Nguluwi Danyeli lima honhu Helile, yalingusoma yavizele vyoili.” <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Aho, wawele Yudeya na wabilimile kuchidunda. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Yawele kuchanya mwa chinduwiko cha ng'handa ya heye, yaleche kidulika kuhola chinhu mng'handa. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Yawele kumgunda yaleche kuhiluka kumbele kuhola nguwo ya heye. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Wochona wawo wamama wawele na himila na walingonyeza zuwa azo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Mumlande Nguluwi leka kubilima kwa hemwe kuleche kuwa mhela wa mbeho ama Zuwa lya Kwesela! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Mina mhela awo kowa na kugaya ng'hatu kohakunalawila kuli mwaluko wa isi mbaka lehano, na hailawila kahi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Wone zuwa azo naziwe hazipunguzigwe, kuduhu munhu ne yumwe yahawele yoloholigwa, ila zuwa azo zipunguzigwa na Nguluwi kwa mbuli ya wala wahaguligwe.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Lelo munhu yowalonjelani mazuwa ago, ‘Mlole Kilistu Mlohozi kahano’ Ama ‘Ka ahala,’ mleche kukunda. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Mina wokuya Kilistu wa udesi na waloli wa udesi. Wodita ulajilo ukulu na vinduzanduza leka wojeza kuwajiliza wala wahaguligwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Mhulichize, mina nandiwalonjela mhela haunafika. <verse eid="MAT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>Lelo howowalonjelani, ‘Mlole, ka kugunuche,’ Mleche kuluta ako, ama, ‘Mlole, kevisa mng'handa,’ Mleche kunda. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Mina kota vila lumwemwesa lwa limlungu kulawa kolilawilaga isanya mbaka kolizibilaga isanya, ahyo ndo vyoiwa kuya kwa Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Ahala hohawele mtufi, ndo hojimema mikungule.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Malichi 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lukasi 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>“Hala hokumala kugaya ako, isanya lowichigwa jiza na nyelezi halibunguzuka. Nhondwe zolagala kulawa kilanga na mong'ho ubatilile vinhu avyo vyeng'ha wotigaswa. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Hamba, ulajilo wa Mwana wa Munhu wokoneka kilanga, na aho nhanzi zeng'ha muisi zodama, womona Mwana wa Munhu yokuya ha ng'hungugu ya kilanga yawele na ludali na ukulu lwinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Na heye kowalajiza wahilisi wa kilanga wa heye wawele na mhalamhanda ilinguyowa ng'hatu, na hewo wowakungajiza wahaguligwe wa heye kuli nzingo zeng'ha zine, kulawila kilanga kweng'ha.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Milanguse kwa kulola ikuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Malichi 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lukasi 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Kwa ikuyu milanguse nhelo ayi, hala nhagala lozikwaluka kutitima na kubahula, mwanguvizela kota mhela wa nhonya wa habehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Hihyo du hemwe homkona mbuli zino zeng'ha ziditikwa, mvizele kota Mwana wa Munhu kahabehi kuya. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, lulelo alu halubagama vinhu avi vyeng'ha havinalawila. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Ulanga na isi zopuluta, ila ulonzi wa heni haupuluta hebu.<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu yavizelele zuwa na saa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Malichi 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Lukasi 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Ila, kwa mbuli ya zuwa ama saa ayo, kuduhu munhu yavizelele yokuya hanili, ne wahilisi wa kilanga, ne Mwana. Mhaza yaliyeng'ha ndo yavizelele. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Kota hila vyonaiwele mhela wa Nuhu, ndo vyoiwa kuya kwa Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Mina mhela awo, mazi tendema nalogang'hali lawila, wanhu wali wolya na kunwa, wohola na kuholeka, mbaka Nuhu loyenjile mgati mwa itumbwi ling'hangala. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Nahawavizelele kwali na choni mbaka gala mazi tendema logalawile, gawabagamiza weng'ha. Ndo vyoiwa mhela Mwana wa Munhu hoyokuya. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Mhela awo wanhu weli wowa kumgunda, yumwe koholigwa na yumwe kolechigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Wadala weli wowa wobalasa sokolo, yumwe koholigwa na yumwe kulechigwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>“Lelo mikale meho, kwa vila hamvizelele zuwa hoyokuya Mkulu wa hemwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Mvizele hino, wone yawele na ng'handa nayavizele mhizi hoyokuya yahawele meho, nahalileka ng'handa ya heye ibenigwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Leka ahyo, mwime goya, kwa vila Mwana wa Munhu kokuya saa yohamuizelele.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chitumagwa yanojile na yehile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Lukasi 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>Yesu kalutilila kulonga, “Yalikohi lelo chitumagwa wa kitumbila na yawele na luhala, wone mkulu wa heye yamuwiche hachanya ha wanhu weng'ha, yawape chilyo kwa mhela wuwula? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Kobweda yula chitumagwa wone mkulu wa heye loyohiluka komfika yodita ahyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, komuwika chitumagwa ayo yalolelaje lufufu lwa heye lweng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Ila wone chitumagwa yehile yelonjele mnhumbula, ‘Mkulu wa heni kakawa kuhiluka,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>Hamba nakwaluka kuwatowa vitumagwa wayage, nakwaluka kulya na kunwa hamwe na walingugala, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>mkulu wa heye mpogozi kokuya zuwa lohalizelele na saa yohaizelele. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Komgaza vibi na kumuwika mchilundo chimwe na wadesi. Ako kowa na chililo na kujejeda mizino.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana kwa wahinza kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Mhela awo, undewa wa kilanga ufanda kota wahinza kumi waholile vyenje vya hewo, waluta kumbochela mkasano. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Wahano wa hewo wali wapoka na wahano wanji wali na luhala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Wala wapoka nawahola chenje za hewo, ila hawaholile na mafuta ga kuwesela. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Ila wala wawele na luhala nawahola mibuli ja mafuta gawo hamwe na chenje za hewo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Kwa vila mkasano na kakawila kuya, wala wahinza weng'ha nawasinzila, wawasa. <verse eid="MAT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>Hagati ha nechilo kwali na iyowe, ‘Mwela yoo, Mkasano kanguya mlute kumbochela.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Aho wala wahinza weng'ha walilimka, waviwika goya vyenje vya hewo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Wala wapoka wawalonjela wala wawele na luhala, ‘Mtujidile mafuta mado ga hemwe mina vyenje vya hetwe vyanguzima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Ila wala nawawele na luhala wawalonjela, ‘Hogotukwila hebu hetwe na hemwe! Igana mlute kowalinguguza mkegulile mwemwe!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Lelo wala wahinza wapoka lowalutile kugula mafuta, mkasano nakafika. Wala wahinza nawawele goya wenjila hamwe na heye mli ng'handa ya mkasano, hamba lwizi luhindigwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>Hamba wala wahinza wanji nawoya, wachema, ‘Mkulu, mkulu, tuchumulile!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Ila heye kawedichila, ‘Ndanguwalonjela ndikomya, siwazelele hemwe.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Hamba Yesu nakasinda kwa kulonga, “Lelo mikale meho, kwa vila hamzelele zuwa ne saa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwalo cha vitumagwa wadatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Lukasi 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Mhela awo Undewa wa Nguluwi wowa kota munhu yumwe yalingwinula majendo kuluta honhu hamwambu, nakawachema vitumagwa wa heye, walolele lufufu lwake. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Nakampa chila yumwe kota mong'ho wa heye vyouwele, yumwe kampa sendi mihako jihano, yunji mihako mili ja sendi na miyage mhako umwe wa sendi, hamba koka. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Lelo yula yapegwe sendi mihako jihano kakola mijito najo kawa na chonjezeche mihako jihano jiyage. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Vivyo na yula yapegwe mihako mili, kazidita zonjezeka mihako mili jiyage. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Ila yula yapegwe mhako umwe, kaluta kabawa hasi, kaivisa ula mhako wa sendi za mkulu wa heye.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“Mhela loupulute, yula mkulu nakahiluka, nakaluka kukagula hisabu ya zowapatile na kutumiya sendi za heye. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Chitumagwa yapegwe migwala jihano nakoya yaholile migwala jihano jonjezeche, nakamlonjela, ‘Mkulu, nakunipa migwala jihano, hano hana migwala jihano jiyage jonjezeche jomhatile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Mkulu wa heye nakamlonjela, ‘Goya, chitumagwa unojile na wakitumbila. Kunoga kuli mbuli ndodo, ndokudita uwe mlolezi wa mbuli zitanganiche. Uye usangalale hamwe na mkulu wa hegwe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>“Chitumagwa yapegwe migwala mili ja sendi nakoya, kalonga, ‘Mkulu, nakunipa migwala mili. Uhole migwala mili jiyage zonjezeche zomhatile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Mkulu wa heye nakamlonjela, ‘Goya, chitumagwa unojile na wakitumbila. Kuwa wakitumbila kwa mbuli ndodo, ndokudita uwe utanganiche mbuli zitanganiche. Uye usangalale hamwe na mkulu wa hegwe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>“Ila yula yapegwe sendi igwala limwe nakoya, kalonga, ‘Mkulu, ndivizela hegwe kwa munhu yang'ang'ale, hegwe kubetaga hala hounyalile, na kukungajiza hala hosanzanze. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Nandumba, nandilivisa igwala lya hegwe hasi. Uhole lelo igwala lya hegwe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>“Mkulu wa heye nakamlonjela, ‘Hegwe kwa chitumagwa wihile na mgata! Kuvizela kota heni sibetaga hala hosinyalile, na kukungajiza hawele hosanzanze. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Naikugana lelo, kuuwika mhako wa sendi ya heni hali hazina, na heni ndaholile mhako wa sendi wa heni na zila zonjezeche! <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Lelo msukuleni ayo mhako wa sendi namkampe yula yawele na mihako kumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Mina, yawele na chinhu kopegwa na konjezelwa. Ila yula yawele hela chinhu, na chila chidodo choyawele nacho choholigwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Na kwa mbuli ya ayu chitumagwa yawele hatanganiche, mlavyeni kunze kuli jiza! Ako kowa na chililo na kujejeda mizino.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Utaguso wa kuduma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Mhela Mwana wa munhu yawele Mndewa loyokuya kuli ukulu wa heye na wahilisi wa kilanga weng'ha hamwe na heye, aho kochikala mchanya mwa chigoda cha heye cha undewa chiukulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Isi zeng'ha zoting'hanika kumwando kwa heye, na heye kowabagula kota vila mdimi yalingubagula ming'holo na mhene. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Kowawika wanhu walingudita yaviganile Nguluwi nzingo ya kudilo kwa heye na wanhu wehile kowawika nzingo ya kumoso kwa heye.<verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>“Hamba Mndewa kowalonjela wala wawele nzingo ya heye kudilo, ‘Muye hemwe mtambichizwe na Mhaza wa heni, bocheleni undewa muwichilwe kulawila kulumbigwa kwa isi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Mina ndali na nzala, hemwe mingalila chilyo, ndali na ng'halu, hemwe mingalila mazi, ndali mjenzi hemwe mmbochela, <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>ndali mwazi, mnvaliza, ndali mtamwa, hemwe muya kundola, ndali mchinweng'ho hemwe muya kunjendela.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Aho, awo wanhu watanganiche womwidichila mndewa ‘Mkulu, hanili natukona uwele na nzala na hetwe tukigalila chilyo, ama uwele na ng'halu na hetwe tukigalila mazi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Hanili natukona uwele mjenzi na hetwe tukubochela hakaye hetu, ama ulihela nguwo na hetwe tukuvaliza? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Hanili natukona uwele mtamwa ama uwele mchinweng'ho na hetwe tuya kukujendela?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Mndewa kowedichila, ‘Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, chila chinhu chomumditile yumwe wa awa wang'holozangu wadodo, mnditila heni.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>“Hamba kowalonjela wala wehile wawele nzingo ya kumoso kwa heye, ‘Ucheni kumwando kwa heni hemwe mpanjilwe! Mlute kuli chiluli cha mazuwa gose ne kuduma yawichilwe Limazoga na wahilisi wa kilanga wa heye. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Ndali na nzala hemwe hamhele chilyo, ndali na ng'halu hemwe hamhele mazi. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Ndali mjenzi hemwe hammbochele, ndali mtamwa na mchinweng'ho hemwe hamuyile kundola.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>“Aho na hewo womwidichila, ‘Mkulu, hanili natukona uwele na nzala ama ng'halu, uwele mjenzi ama ulihela nguwo, na uwele mtamwa ama ulimchinweng'ho, hetwe hatukuditile chinhu?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Na heye kowedichila, ‘Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, chila lomlemile kumditila mbuli azi yumwe wa wanhu awa wadodo, namlema kunditila heni.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Lelo awa woluta kuli kugazigwa kwa mazuwa gose, ila wala watanganiche woluta kuli ukomu wa mazuwa gose ne kuduma.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Uhesi wa kumkopola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malichi 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lukasi 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesu loyasindile kulonga ago geng'ha, kawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Mvizela kota mazuwa meli galinguya kowa na mnvina ya Pasaka, na Mwana wa Munhu kolavigwa leka yawambigwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Mhela awo watambika wakulu na wasekulu wa wanhu nawating'hana kuli chipepela cha Kayafa, mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Walongasa vyowomibata Yesu kwa chinyele hamba wamkopole. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Ila walonga, “Mbuli ayo ileche kukoleka mhela wa mnvina ya Pasaka, kuleche kulawila kilewa na kibagula hali wanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubakalizwa unhunyhililo Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Malichi 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesu loyali Betaniya, hakaye kwa Simoni, yawele nguchemigwa Mkoma, <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>mdala yumwe yawele na libuli lya alabasta iwele na unhunyhililo wa sendi nyinji, kamuyila hala mchisaga hoyekale kulya chilyo, kamgudulila awo unhunyhililo kumutwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Walanguswa wa heye lowawene ago nawazudila walonga, “Ya choni kuwifya aku?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Unhunyhililo awu wahaguzigwe kwa sendi nyinji na wahapegwe wazunwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesu nakagazela majesa gawo, kawalonjela, “Ndaze lekachoni mwangumgaza ayu mdala? Heye kanditila mbuli inojile. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Wazunwa mwanawo mazuwa geng'ha, ila heni siwa na hemwe mazuwa gose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Ayu mdala loyali yonjidila unhunyhililo nayali yombika goya kwa kutiligwa kwa heni mchilaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, koneche kweng'ha muisi Mbuli Inojile yodamligwa, chinhu chino choyaditile ayu mdala chodamligwa kwa kumkumbuchila heye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda Isikalioti kangumbelenhuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Malichi 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lukasi 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Hamba, Yudasi Isikalioti, yumwe wa wala kumi na weli, nakaluta kwa watambika wakulu, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>kawalonjela, “Mondigalila choni wone ndimlavye Yesu kwa hemwe?” Wamuwazila migwala makumi gadatu ga sendi, <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>na baho Yudasi nayali yopala ndaze vyoyombelenhuka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulya ndiya ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Malichi 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Lukasi 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Zuwa lya mwaluko lya mnvina ya mibumunda johajiwichigwe usaso, walanguswa nawamlutila Yesu wamuuza, “Kwangugana kohi tukuwichile goya ndiya ya Pasaka?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Heye nakawedichila, “Luteni kuli muji kwa munhu yumwe, mumlonjele, ‘Mlangusa kangulonga, mhela wa heni ufika, kwa hegwe ndolya Pasaka hamwe na walanguswa wa heni.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Walanguswa wadita kota Yesu vyoyawalajize, nawawika goya ndiya ya Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Lokuwele matinazo, Yesu kekalisa mchisaga hamwe na walanguswa wa heye kumi na weli. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Lowali wolya, Yesu kalonga, “Ndanguwalonjelani ndikomya, yumwe wa hemwe kombelenhuka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Walanguswa nawesinza ng'hatu, waluka kiuza yumweyumwe, “Mkulu, ndaze nda heni?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesu kedichila, “Heye yodiliza ibumunda hamwe na heni kuli chisaye ndo heye yombelenhuka. Kulya hamwe nayali ndo ulajilo wa kigana. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Ena, Ndangukomya Mwana wa Munhu kobagama kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogawele longa mbuli ya heye, ila mane yuye munhu ayo yalingumgalamka Mwana wa Munhu! Nayahawele goya munhu ayo wone nahaleleche.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yudasi, ndo yula yaganile kumbelenhuka, kamuuza, “Mlangusa, ndaze nda heni?” Yesu kamwidichila, “Ena hegwe kulonga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiya ya Mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Malichi 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lukasi 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Nalowali wolya, Yesu kahola ibumunda, kamtogola Nguluwi, kaumogola, kawagawila walanguswa yolonga, “Mhole mulye, alu ndo lukuli lwa heni.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Hamba kahola chizombe, katambichiza, kawapa yolonga, “Munwe weng'ha, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>mina ayi ndo danda ya heni ilingweneza ilagano lya Nguluwi na wanhu wa heye, danda ilingubohoka kwa chiwalo cha wanhu weng'ha kuwosela gehile ga hewo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Ndanguwalonjelani, sinwa kahi divai ya zabibu mbaka zuwa lila ndinwa divai inyale hamwe na hemwe kuli undewa wa Mhaza wa heni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Lowasindile kwimba lwimbo, woka, nawaluta kuli chidunda cha Mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga kota Petili kombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malichi 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lukasi 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela, “Nechilo ayi ya lehano, hemwe mweng'ha mombilima na kundeka ndiliyeka, mina Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">“ ‘Ndomtowa mdimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">na chilundo cha ming'holo chosambaluka.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Ila londizilipuka, ndowalongola Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Petili nakamlonjela Yesu, “Wone hewo wawe na majesa na hegwe nakukuleka, heni sikuleka hebu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ndangukulonjela ndikomya, nechilo yiyino izogolo halineka, kombela kadatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Petili nakamlonjela, “Wone iwe inganile kubagama, sikubela ng'oo.” Na wala walanguswa wanji weng'ha nawalonga hihyo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulanda kuli kagunda ka Gesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Malichi 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lukasi 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Hamba Yesu kaluta nawo kuli kamgunda ka migodi Getisemane, kawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Mikale hano na heni ndute hala hamwando ndikalande.”<verse eid="MAT 26:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Nakawahola Petili na wana weli wa Sebedayo, nakaluka kuwa na masinzo na kugaya. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Aho nakawalonjela, “Ndina masinzo lukami mnhumbula habehi kubagama. Mikale baha meho hamwe na heni.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Lelo nakaluta hamwando hado, kagwa chifunama, kalanda, “Mhaza wa heni, wone vyoiwa, chizombe achi chikole hafungo, ila haiwele vyondilingugana heni, leka kota vyoulingugana hegwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Nakawalutila wala walanguswa kawafika wawasile. Nakamlonjela Petili, “Ndo kulonga mlemwela kikala meho hamwe na heni ne saa imwe? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Mikale meho na kulanda mleche kwinjila kuli kujezigwa. Muhe wa munhu wangugana kudita ganojile ila lukuli lwa ng'hochele.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Nakaluta kahi lwa keli kulanda, “Mhaza wa heni, wone hailinguganigwa chizombe cha magazo chikole heni ne kuchinwa, leka igano lya hegwe lyenele.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Nakawalutila kahi, nakawafika wawasile, mina meho gawo nagali gebatigwe na usinjizi.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Baho, kawaleka, nakaluta kulanda lwa kadatu kwa luzi lulula. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Hamba kawalutila wala walanguswa, kawalonjela, “Ndaze, mng'hali muwasile na kwesela? Mlole! Mhela wuya, Mwana wa Munhu kanguwichigwa mmoko mwa wanhu wawele na gehile. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Mwinuche tucheni. Mlole! Kanguya yula munhu yalingunhyinduka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangibatika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Malichi 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lukasi 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Lelo Yesu naloyang'hali yolonga na hewo, baho nakoya Yudasi, yumwe wa wala kumi na weli. Hamwe na heye woya na wanhu wenji wawele na mipanga na nyimbati kulawa kwa watambika wakulu na wasekulu wa wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Ayo yaganile kumbelenhuka Yesu, nayali yawapele ulajilo yolonga, “Yula munhu yondimnonela mizeze ndo heye, mibateni.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Baho, Yuda kamhejelela Yesu, nakamlonjela, “Ulamche, mlangusa!” Hamba kamnonela. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mng'holozangu, udite chouwinzile kudita.!” Aho wala wanhu woya, wamibata Yesu, wamuwika mmoko.<verse eid="MAT 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Yumwe wa wala wawele hamwe na Yesu nakagolola moko, nakasomola ipanga, kamtowa chitumagwa wa Mtambika Mkulu, nakamdumula ikutu. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Aho Yesu nakamlonjela, “Hiluse ipanga lyako muyala, mina yoneche yalingutowa kwa ipanga, kobagama kwa ipanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Ndaze, hamvizelele kota ndahawezile kumlanda Mhaza wa heni na heye yahangalile wamizi vilundo kumi na vili vya wahilisi wa kilanga? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Ila gokwenela ndaze Maandiko Matakatifu galingulonga kota vyoilinguganigwa ilawile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Mhela wuwo Yesu kalulonjela alo lung'hongola lwa wanhu woyile kumibata, “Ndaze, muya kundibata kwa nyimbati na mipanga kota vila heni nda mbokaji? Chila zuwa ndali mng'handa ya Nguluwi ndilangusa, na hamndibate! <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Ila aga geng'ha gakoleka leka Maandiko Matakatifu ga waloli genele.” Hamba walanguswa weng'ha nawamleka, nawabilima.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hamwando ha balaza lya wayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Malichi 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lukasi 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Lelo awo wanhu wamibate Yesu nawamhilika hakaye kwa Kayafa, mtambika mkulu, kowekungajize walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na wasekulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Petili nakamuwinza Yesu kwa kutali mbaka kuchipepela cha mtambika mkulu, kenjila mng'handa hamwe na wamizi leka yalole mbuli zizangulawila. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Lelo watambika wakulu na balaza lyeng'ha nawapala ulolezi wa udesi kwa Yesu wogana wamkopole, <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>ila hawawene chinhu choneche chila, hanga nawoya walolezi wenji wa udesi. Mwiso nawoya walolezi weli, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>nawalonga, “Munhu ayu nakalonga, ‘Ndoweza kugwisa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuizenga kahi kwa mazuwa gadatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Mtambika mkulu nakema kamuuza Yesu, “Ndaze, hulingwidichila ne chinhu? Wanhu awa wangulavya ulolezi wachi kwa hegwe?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Ila Yesu nakanyamalila tulu. Kahi mtambika mkulu nakamlonjela, “Wilahe kwa itagwa lya Nguluwi yawele mkomu, tulonjele kota hegwe ndo Kilistu Mlohozi, mwana wa Nguluwi!” <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ena, hegwe kwangulonga! Ila ndanguwalonjelani, kulawa sambi momona Mwana wa Munhu yekale kudilo kwa yula Mkulu yawele na ludali yokuya kuchanya kuli ng'hungugu kilanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Baho mtambika mkulu kadega nguwo za heye, kalonga, “Kamkovula Nguluwi! Twangugana choni kahi? Sambi muhulika yomkovula Nguluwi kwa heye. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Hemwe mwangona ndaze?” Hewo wamwidichila, “Imgana yabagame!” <verse eid="MAT 26:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Hamba wamtemela mite kumeho, wamzabula kwa viganza. Wanji lowali womzabula kwa viganza, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>nawalonga, “Hegwe Kilistu Mlohozi, tulagulile lelo, yalikohi yakutowile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Malichi 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lukasi 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Petili yaliyekale kunze kunzingo. Lelo chitumagwa yumwe mdala kamlutila, nakalonga, “Hegwe wali hamwe na Yesu wa Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Petili nakabela kwa weng'ha wala, nakalonga, “Sivizelele choni choulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Loyali yolawa mlwizi, chitumagwa yunji mdala nakamona, nakawalonjela wala wawele hala, “Munhu ayu nayali hamwe na Yesu wa Nasaleti.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Petili nakabela kahi aku yochilaha, “Simzelele munhu ayo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Hamba hado hela, wanhu wawele hala wamlutila Petili, wamlonjela, “Twangukomya, hegwe nagwe kwa yumwe wa hewo, mina kuzeleka kwa aila ndonga hela kota hegwe kulawila Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Aho Petili nakaluka kipanjila na kilaaha yolonga, “Heni simzelele munhu ayo!” Baho du izogolo nalika. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Petili nakakumbuchila ulonzi woyalonjelwe na Yesu, “Izogolo halineka, kombela kadatu kota hunzelele heni.” Lelo Petili kalawa kunze, nakalila lukami.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguhilikwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Malichi 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Lukasi 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Lokubwemwenzuche, watambika wakulu weng'ha na wasekulu wa wanhu nawaheha mbuli ya Yesu wogana wamkopole. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Wamuwoha luzabi, wamuhola, wamuhilika kwa Pilato mkulu wa mkowa yahaguligwe na mndewa wa Loma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Madito 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Aho, Yudasi, yula yambelenhuche Yesu, loyawene kota mina wamtagusa kwa wihe Yesu, nakawa na masinzo lukami, nakawahilusila watambika wakulu vila vihande makumi gadatu vya sendi. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Nakawalonjela, “Ndita gehile kwa kumlavya munhu yawele hela nongwa yakopoligwe.” Ila hewo walonga, “Yangutuwala choni hetwe? Ayo mbuli ya hegwe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Na heye nakataga zila sendi mng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakalawa kunze, kaza kinhweng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Watambika wakulu nawazihola zila sendi, walonga, “Haiwa goya kuziwika kuli ng'hano ya ng'handa ya Nguluwi, mina ndo sendi za danda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Baho naweuza, nawahola zila sendi wazagula mgunda wa ilongo, hawe honhu ha kutilila wajenzi. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Ndo mina mbaka lehano mgunda awo wanguchemigwa, “Mgunda wa Danda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Ahyo ulonzi wa mloli Yelemiya wenela, “Nawahola vihande makumi gadatu vya sendi, kwa kihwana na yula munhu, yawele wanhu wa Isilaeli wamguzile, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>nawagula mgunda wa ilongo kwa sendi zizo, kota vila mkulu vyoyandajize.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato kangumuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Malichi 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Lukasi 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesu nawamwimiza kumwando kwa mkulu wa mkowa. Lelo mkulu wa mkowa nakamuuza, “Ndaze, hambi hegwe ndo mndewa wa Wayahudi?” Yesu nakamwidichila, “Ena, hegwe nakulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Ila watambika wakulu na wasekulu nalowali womuuza, nayali hambe yawedichile. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Ahyo Pilato nakamuuza, “Ndaze, hulinguhulika ulonjelezi awo weng'ha walingulavya kwa hegwe?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Ila Yesu hedichile ne chinhu, ahyo mkulu wa mkowa nakabubuwala ng'hatu.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangutagusigwa kubagama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Malichi 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lukasi 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Nayali izoweleche mhela wa mnvina ya Pasaka mkulu wa mkowa kuwachumulila Wayahudi munhu yumwe wamganile yawele mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Mhela awo nakwali na munhu yumwe yawele mchinweng'ho yazeleche lukami, itagwa lyake Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Ahyo, wanhu loweting'hane hamwe, Pilato nakawauza, “Mwangugana ndimchumulile yalikohi kuli awa weli, Balaba ama Yesu yalinguchemigwa Kilistu Mlohozi?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Nakalonga hino kwa vila nakavizela kota nawamigala kwa heye kwa mbuli ya kumonela fihi hela.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilato naloyawele yekale hali chigoda cha heye cha utaguso, mdala wa heye nakamhilichila usenga awu, “Uleche kiyinjiza kuli utaguso wa munhu yuno yatanganiche, mina lehano ngazika lukami londali ndilota kwa mbuli ya heye.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Ila watambika wakulu na wasekulu nawawakola lupichi wanhu walande Balaba yachumulilwe na Yesu yabagame. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Mkulu wa mkowa nakawauza, “Yalikohi kuli awa weli yomlingugana ndimchumulile?” Wamwidichila, “Balaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilato nakawauza, “Lelo ndite choni na Yesu yalinguchemigwa Kilistu Mlohozi?” Weng'ha nawalonga, “Yawambigwe mumsalaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilato nakauza, “Lekachoni? Nakadita wihe wachi?” Hewo nawalutilila kutowa iyowe, “Yawambigwe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Baho, Pilato loyawene kota hawalingukunda chila choyaliyolonga, na ivuche nalyali lyaluche, nakahola mazi, nakahovuga moko hali wala wanhu wamemile, nakalonga, “Heni ndamduhu kwa mbuli ya kubagama kwa munhu ayu, mane mwemwe baho!” <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Wanhu weng'ha nawalonga, “Danda ya heye na iwe kwa hetwe na wana wa hetwe!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Aho Pilato nakawachumulila Balaba kulawa mchinweng'ho, na Yesu yazapigwe ng'hobwa hamba nakamlavya yawambigwe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wamizi wangumbeza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Malichi 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Hamba wamizi wa Pilato nawamwinjiza Yesu mng'handa ya mkulu wa Loma, wekungajiza chilundo cheng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Wamvula nguwo, wamvalisa ikanzu lya chiundewa. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Hamba watowa itaji lya miwa ifandile kota chipembelo, wamvalisa kumutwi, wamuwichila kahi idenje kuli moko wa heye wa kudilo. Wamfugamila kumwando kwa heye, wambeza wolonga, “Ulamche Mndewa wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Wamtemela mite, walihola lila idenje, wamsubulila kumutwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Lowasindile kumbeza, wamvula lila ikanzu, wamvalisa nguwo za heye, hamba wamhilika kumuwamba mumsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwambigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malichi 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lukasi 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Lowali woluta, nawamfika munhu yumwe itagwa lyake Simoni, mwenyeng'haye wa Kilene, wamizi wamkola lupichi yapiche msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Lowafichile honhu halihochemigwa Goligota, hazeleche honhu ha “Izeje lya Mutwi”. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Wamnweza mhanzanyo wa divai na chinhu chiliusungu. Ila Yesu loyajezile nakalema kunwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, hamba wegawila nguwo za heye kwa kuzitowela simbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Nawekala baho, wawa womlolela. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Hachanya ha mutwi wa heye nawawika utaguso wa heye wandichigwe, “Ayu ndo Yesu, Mndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Wabokaji weli nawawambigwa mumsalaba hamwe na heye, yumwe kudilo na yumwe kumoso.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Wanhu wawele wokola honhu hala wali womliga na wotigasa mitwi jawo na kulonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>“Hegwe! Ndo nakivuna kota kogwisa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuizenga kuli mazuwa gadatu? Lelo ilohole gwegwe. Wone hegwe uli Mwana wa Nguluwi, uduliche mumsalaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Vivyo du na watambika wakulu hamwe na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na wasekulu nawambeza wolonga, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Nakawalohola wanji, ila kilohola yuye kangulemwa! Hambi, heye ndo Mndewa wa Isilaeli! Hambi, lelo yeduliche hasi kulawa mumsalaba, na hetwe tomkunda. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Naketumbila Nguluwi na kulonga eti heye ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi, lelo Nguluwi yamlohole one yalingumgana.” <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Hihyo na wala wabokaji wawambigwe hamwe na Yesu mumsalaba nawaliwomliga.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubagama mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malichi 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lukasi 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Kulawila saa tisa matinazo, jiza naigubika isi yeng'ha. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Loifichile saa tisa matinazo, Yesu nakalila kwa lizi likulu, “Eloi, Eloi, lema sabakitani?” Ilinguzeleka, “Nguluwi wa heni, Nguluwi wa heni, lekachoni kundeka?” <verse eid="MAT 27:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Ila wala nawemile hala lowahuliche ahyo walonga, “Kangumchema Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Yumwe wa hewo nakabilima, nakahola sichi, kadiliza kuli divai izazame, kawika mli idenje, kamha yanwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Wanji nawalonga, “Tandi tulole wone Eliya kanguya kumlohola.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Baho, Yesu nakalila kahi kwa lizi likulu, hamba muhe nauleka lukuli.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Baho ipaziya ligazi lya kudinya honhu helile ng'hatu ha ng'handa ya Nguluwi lidejeka vihande vili kulawa kuchanya mbaka hasi, isi naitigasika, mitalawe najitulika, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>vilaga navigubuka na wanhu wenji wa Nguluwi welile nawabagame, wazilipuligwa, <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>na hewo, loyazilipuche heye Yesu, walawa mvilaga, wenjila Yelusalemu muji welile, woneka na wanhu wenji.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Lelo mkulu wa wamizi na wamizi wa Yesu lowawene limachinyina na gala galawile, nawadumba heko, nawalonga, “Ena, kwa kukomya munhu ayu nayali Mwana wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Honhu aho hali na wadala wenji wolola kwa kutali. Awo wadala ndo wala wamuwinzile Yesu kulawila Galilaya womtanza. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Mumo wali Maliya Madelena, Maliya mayao Yakubu na Yusufu, hamwe na mayao wana wa Sebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutiligwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malichi 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lukasi 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Loifichile matinazo, mina nakoya munhu yawele na lufufu mwenyeng'haye wa Alimataya, itagwa lyake Yusufu. Na heye kahi nayali mlanguswa wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Nakamlutila Pilato, nakalanda yapegwe lukuli lwa Yesu. Baho, Pilato nakakunda yapegwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yusufu nakaluhola lula lukuli, kaubumbiliza sanda nzelu ng'hatu, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>nakuwika mgati mwa chilaga chinyale choyali yahongole kuli italawe. Hamba kabidusa iganga ikulu kadinya hali lwizi lwa chilaga, koka. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Maliya Madelena na yula Maliya yunji wali wekale wolola chilaga.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wamizi wangulolela chilaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Hamitondo, zuwa iyage ila ya kwesela, watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo nawamlutila Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>nawalonga, “Mkulu, tukumbuchila kota yula mhadi loyali mkomu nakalonga ‘Zuwa lya kadatu ndozilipuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Lelo twangugana chilaga chilolelwe na wamizi mbaka zuwa lya kadatu, leka walanguswa wa heye waleche kuya nakumuhiza na kuwalonjela wanhu kota kazilipuka. Udesi awu wa kuduma wowa wihile lukami kusinda ula wa mwaluko.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilato nakawalonjela, “goya, mwanawo wamizi, mlute mkalolele kota vyomvizelele.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Lelo waluta walolela chilaga, nawazenjelela mchanya mwa iganga na wawaleka baho wamizi wololela.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Kuzilipuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Malichi 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lukasi 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Loimalile Zuwa lya Kwesela, behi na kubwemwenzuka zuwa ila ya Jumapili, Maliya Madelena na yula Maliya yunji, nawaluta kulola chila chilaga. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Baho du nakulawila limachinyina, mhilisi wa kilanga wa Mkulu nakadulika kulawa kilanga, kalibidusa lila iganga hafungo, nakulikalila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Nakoneka kota lumwemwesa na nguwo zoyavalile zali nzelu chweya! <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Wamizi wa chila chilaga nawakakama aku wodumba heko, nawazilika kota wanhu wabagame. <verse eid="MAT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Ila yula mhilisi wa kilanga nakawalonjela wala wadala, “Hemwe mleche kudumba! Ndivizela kota mwangumpala Yesu yawambigwe mumsalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Haduhu hano mina kazilipuka kota vyonayalonjile. Muye mlole honhu howamuwichile. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Lelo mlute himahima mkawalonjele walanguswa wa heye kuta kazilipuka kulawa kowabagame, na sambi kanguwalongola Galilaya, ako momona heye. Mkumbuche ulonzi awu wondiwalonjele.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Wawele wodumba na kusangalala kukulu, awo wadala nawoka himahima hali chilaga, nawabilima kuluta kuwalonjela walanguswa wa heye.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Baho, Yesu nakating'hana na hewo, nakalonga, “Mlamche hemwe.” Hewo wadala wamlutila, webata magulu ga heye na kumfugamila. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mleche kudumba! Luteni mkawalonjele wang'holozangu walute Galilaya, na ako wombona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguto ya wamizi wa chilaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Wala wadala lowaliwoluta, wamwe wa wamizi wa chilaga nawaluta kuli muji kulonga kwa wakulu wa watambika kwa zila mbuli zeng'ha lozilawile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Lelo nawating'hana hamwe na wasekulu, lowasindile kudogola, wawapa wala wamizi sendi nyinji <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>wolonga, “Hemwe molonga ahi, ‘Walanguswa wa heye nawoya nechilo, wahiza lukuli lwa heye hetwe lotwali tuwasile.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Na one mkulu wa mkowa yaizele mbuli ayi, hetwe tolonga na heye leka hemwe mleche kugazigwa.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Wala wamizi nawazihola zila sendi, nawadita kota vyowalanguswe. Mbuli ayo yenela hali Wayahudi weng'ha mbaka lehano.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalawila walanguswa wa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malichi 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lukasi 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Madito 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Wala walanguswa kumi na yumwe nawaluta Galilaya kuli chila chidunda choyawalajize Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Lowamuwene, wamfugamila, hanga wanji wali na majesa. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu nakoya habehi, kawalonjela, “Mpegwa ludali lweng'ha kilanga na muisi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Luteni lelo, mkawadite wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wawe walanguswa wa heni, muwabatize kwa itagwa lya Mhaza na lya Mwana na lya Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>Muwalanguse kibatilila malajizo geng'ha gondiwapele. Na heni nda hamwe na hemwe mazuwa geng'ha, mbaka kuduma kwa isi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
